{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nk221MwrBicCEq5BeUTM7D","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 零样本 baseline，Qwen3-8B，无约束生成\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n7\t      \"EV_pct\": 24.0,\n8\t      \"RoV_pct\": 74.9,\n9\t      \"AC_pct\": 0.3,\n10\t      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n11\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 11.84,\n12\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n13\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.09\n14\t    },\n15\t    \"tables\": [],\n16\t    \"figures\": [],\n17\t    \"analysis\": \"RoV 74.9% 是 cross-task story 的核心 baseline 数据点。与 RE 的 RV 1.39% 对比（53× 差距），直接支持 \\\"more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement\\\"。但 median 档下 1 位审稿人会质疑 \\\"this simply reflects the model's inability to do zero-shot EE, not the need for constraint decoding\\\"。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_qwen_wikievents_unconstrained）。\\nEV=24%：约四分之一生成的事件类型不在 KAIROS 56 个 leaf-node 类型中——Qwen 倾向生成更通用的事件描述（如 \\\"Attack\\\" 而非 \\\"Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode\\\" 的扁平化形式）。\\nRoV=74.9%：压倒性违规，80 个 argument role 高度条件化于事件类型，零样本模型无法推断 per-event-type 的合法 role 集合。这是 EE 与 RE 的关键差异——RE 的 RV 仅 1.39%（SciERC），EE 的 role constraint 复杂度高一个数量级。\\nEntity F1=0%：非语义能力问题，而是 format compliance——unconstrained JSON 结构不符合 parser 预期，entity mentions 无法被识别。\\nMedian 档意义：建立了 \\\"EE 的 constraint violation 远超 RE\\\" 的 baseline 论据，但 F1≈0% 被审稿人标记为 \\\"low F1 regime 削弱了 violation analysis 的实践意义\\\"。\\n\"\n18\t  },\n19\t  {\n20\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\",\n21\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 零样本 baseline，Llama-3.1-8B，无约束生成\",\n22\t    \"results\": {\n23\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 91.9,\n24\t      \"EV_pct\": 10.5,\n25\t      \"RoV_pct\": 88.8,\n26\t      \"AC_pct\": 0.1,\n27\t      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n28\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 5.72,\n29\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n30\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0\n31\t    },\n32\t    \"tables\": [],\n33\t    \"figures\": [],\n34\t    \"analysis\": \"Llama 的 EV↓但 RoV↑ pattern 是 cross-model analysis 中的独立 finding，但 median 档下审稿人将其视为 \\\"expected: event types are simpler to learn than argument roles\\\" 而非深刻洞察。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_llama_wikievents_unconstrained）。\\nEV=10.5% 是三模型最低——Llama 的事件类型词汇覆盖最好，但 RoV=88.8% 是三模型最高。这揭示了一个正交性 pattern：同一模型在不同 constraint dimension 上的 violation 不成正比。Llama 能正确命名事件类型但在 role assignment 上最差——role 是 schema-specific 的，与一般语言知识无关。\\n与 RE 中 Llama 的 RV=0.55%（SciERC）对比：同一模型在 RE 中 relation vocabulary 几乎完美，在 EE 中 role vocabulary 几乎全错——任务结构决定违规模式，不是模型能力的单一维度。\\n\"\n35\t  },\n36\t  {\n37\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\",\n38\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 零样本 baseline，Mistral-7B-v0.3，无约束生成\",\n39\t    \"results\": {\n40\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 78.9,\n41\t      \"EV_pct\": 37.3,\n42\t      \"RoV_pct\": 63.9,\n43\t      \"AC_pct\": 0.0,\n44\t      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n45\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 2.41,\n46\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n47\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0\n48\t    },\n49\t    \"tables\": [],\n50\t    \"figures\": [],\n51\t    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 提供了 post-hoc non-viability 的最极端 case：EV+RoV 合计约 100%，意味着几乎每个 argument 至少违反一种约束。在 median 档下这是对 \\\"post-hoc 在 EE 不可行\\\" 结论的最强支撑。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_mistral_wikievents_unconstrained）。\\nEV=37.3% 三模型最高——SentencePiece 32K vocab 对 hierarchical event names 的 BPE 分解产生更多 OOV。Parse rate 仅 78.9%——Mistral 在复杂 structured generation 任务上 format compliance 最差。\\nRoV=63.9% 反而是三模型最低——原因是 EV 已经过滤掉大量 events（event type 本身就错了，role 无从检查）。如果归一化到 valid-event-type arguments，Mistral 的有效 role violation 率可能与 Llama 相当。\\nTrigger F1 仅 2.4%，几乎完全失败。\\n\"\n52\t  },\n53\t  {\n54\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral grammar_only v3\",\n55\t    \"description\": \"Mistral WikiEvents grammar-only 消融，证明 semantic layer 对 EE 是 necessary\",\n56\t    \"results\": {\n57\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n58\t      \"EV_pct\": 0.0,\n59\t      \"RoV_pct\": 64.0,\n60\t      \"AC_pct\": 13.8,\n61\t      \"CF_pct\": 1.1,\n62\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 3.37,\n63\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 11.92,\n64\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.27\n65\t    },\n66\t    \"tables\": [\n67\t      {\n68\t        \"name\": \"EE ablation: grammar_only vs full_s1 (violation rates)\",\n69\t        \"description\": \"Side-by-side: Mistral grammar_only vs full_s1，5 violation types，突出 RoV 64%→0% 的 gap 来自 semantic layer\"\n70\t      }\n71\t    ],\n72\t    \"figures\": [],\n73\t    \"analysis\": \"这是 EE 章节中最重要的消融实验。Grammar→EV=0% 但 RoV=64% 这一 gap 直接证明：(1) grammar layer 解决词汇约束（EV），(2) semantic layer 解决上下文条件约束（RoV），(3) 两层架构缺一不可。AC 的 latent surfacing 进一步印证 enabling dependency：没有 grammar 消除 EV，semantic layer 对 AC 的 enforcement 效果被噪声淹没。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_mistral_wikievents_grammar_only_v3）。\\nEV→0%：grammar CFG 约束有效事件类型词汇，100% 消除事件类型违规。\\nRoV=64%（几乎未变，unconstrained 63.9%）：grammar CFG 无法约束 80 个 argument roles 条件化于 event type 的合法集——这需要 stateful semantic layer 在生成时维护 event context 并查询 per-type role constraints。这是 \\\"enabling dependency 在 EE 中的结构性必然\\\" 的关键证据。\\nAC=13.8%（从 unconstrained 0%↑）：latent violation surfacing pattern——grammar 强制合法事件类型后，原本被 EV 掩盖的 argument constraint violations 暴露。与 RE 的 DocRED grammar_only DR=26.17% > unconstrained 18.46% 完全一致。\\nMedian 档意义：这个消融 pattern 在 Mistral 单模型上清晰建立了 \\\"two-layer necessity for EE\\\"，但审稿人在 median 档认为仅 1 模型的消融 \\\"adequate but not comprehensive\\\"。\\n\"\n74\t  },\n75\t  {\n76\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\",\n77\t    \"description\": \"Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE — 99.6-100% argument deletion 证明 post-hoc 在 EE 不可行\",\n78\t    \"results\": {\n79\t      \"qwen_args_total\": 5467,\n80\t      \"qwen_args_surviving\": 23,\n81\t      \"qwen_rejection_pct\": 99.6,\n82\t      \"qwen_arg_f1_posthoc\": 0.017,\n83\t      \"llama_args_total\": 5053,\n84\t      \"llama_args_surviving\": 3,\n85\t      \"llama_rejection_pct\": 99.9,\n86\t      \"llama_arg_f1_posthoc\": 0.0,\n87\t      \"mistral_args_total\": 6034,\n88\t      \"mistral_args_surviving\": 0,\n89\t      \"mistral_rejection_pct\": 100.0,\n90\t      \"mistral_arg_f1_posthoc\": 0.0\n91\t    },\n92\t    \"tables\": [\n93\t      {\n94\t        \"name\": \"Table: Post-hoc rejection rate, RE vs EE\",\n95\t        \"description\": \"SciERC / DocRED / WikiEvents × 3 models, rejection % + surviving arguments + F1 before/after\"\n96\t      }\n97\t    ],\n98\t    \"figures\": [],\n99\t    \"analysis\": \"Post-hoc EE 数据是 paper 中最 \\\"devastating\\\" 的对比之一，但在 median 档下其叙事价值被 \\\"low F1 regime\\\" caveat 打折扣。论文必须 frame 为 mechanism comparison（\\\"even if both approaches extract few correct arguments, constrained decoding produces structurally valid output while post-hoc produces nothing\\\"），不是 F1 comparison。\\n\\n\\n数据已从 v3 结果计算（ee_*_wikievents_constrained_v3 中的 posthoc_args_removed 字段）。\\n核心机制：EE unconstrained baselines 中 RoV 63-89% + EV 10-37%，几乎每个 argument 至少违反一种约束。Post-hoc 必须删除所有含任何违规的 argument，连锁效应导致 99.6-100% 删除。\\n与 RE 对比：RE post-hoc 在 SciERC 删除 16.8%，DocRED 48.1%——EE 的删除率是 RE 的 2-6×。根本原因：RE 的违规集中在 per-triple level（DR：head/tail type 不匹配），大量 triple 其他字段合法；EE 的 RoV 是 per-argument level 且覆盖 >60% 的 arguments，连锁删除近乎全部。\\nMedian 档评价：审稿人全部接受 \\\"post-hoc non-viable for EE\\\" 结论，但 1 位标记 \\\"comparison is trivial at Arg F1 ≈ 0% — both approaches produce near-zero useful output in the zero-shot EE setting\\\"。\\n\"\n100\t  },\n101\t  {\n102\t    \"name\": \"70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\",\n103\t    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC，scale dimension\",\n104\t    \"results\": {\n105\t      \"unconstrained_DR_pct\": 6.5,\n106\t      \"unconstrained_RV_pct\": 0.6,\n107\t      \"unconstrained_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n108\t      \"unconstrained_CF_pct\": 0.0,\n109\t      \"unconstrained_R_F1_pct\": 11.22,\n110\t      \"unconstrained_E_F1_pct\": 35.17,\n111\t      \"constrained_DR_pct\": 0.0,\n112\t      \"constrained_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n113\t      \"constrained_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n114\t      \"constrained_CF_pct\": 3.66,\n115\t      \"constrained_R_F1_pct\": 11.24,\n116\t      \"constrained_E_F1_pct\": 35.14,\n117\t      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 100.0,\n118\t      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": 0.02\n119\t    },\n120\t    \"tables\": [],\n121\t    \"figures\": [],\n122\t    \"analysis\": \"SciERC 70B 在 median 档放入 §5.5 而非主实验。Frame 为 \\\"at 70B, unconstrained violations diminish but do not vanish; constrained decoding provides the guarantee that scale alone cannot\\\"。R_F1 neutral (+0.02pp) 支持 \\\"zero cost\\\" claim。CF 3.66% < 8B，beam search k=4 可进一步消除。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，70b_scierc_unconstrained + 70b_scierc_constrained）。\\n70B unconstrained DR=6.5%——比 8B Qwen 15.37% 低 58%，比 8B Llama 13.34% 低 51%。Scale 确实减少违规：70B 的 instruction following 更强，能更好地遵循 schema 结构。RV 仅 0.6%（8B Qwen 1.39%，8B Llama 0.55%），说明 70B 对 relation vocabulary 已近乎完美。\\nConstrained DR=0%（完全消除），R_F1 +0.02pp（不可区分于噪声），CF=3.66%（低于 8B Qwen 9.90%，低于 8B Llama 6.56%）。\\nMedian 档困境：SciERC 70B 结果看似出色（DR 100% reduction），但这恰恰削弱了 constrained decoding 的必要性论证——如果 70B 的 unconstrained DR 已经很低（6.5%），constrained 的绝对改善仅 6.5pp，审稿人会问 \\\"is 6.5% DR worth the overhead of constrained decoding at 70B scale?\\\"。回答依赖 compliance-critical framing。\\n\"\n123\t  },\n124\t  {\n125\t    \"name\": \"70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\",\n126\t    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 on DocRED，scale dimension。当前 RUNNING。\",\n127\t    \"results\": {\n128\t      \"unconstrained_DR_pct\": 5.8,\n129\t      \"unconstrained_RV_pct\": 3.4,\n130\t      \"unconstrained_ET_pct\": 0.05,\n131\t      \"unconstrained_CF_pct\": 0.08,\n132\t      \"unconstrained_R_F1_pct\": 10.6,\n133\t      \"unconstrained_R_P_pct\": 9.0,\n134\t      \"unconstrained_R_R_pct\": 12.9,\n135\t      \"unconstrained_E_F1_pct\": 63.2,\n136\t      \"unconstrained_E_P_pct\": 62.8,\n137\t      \"unconstrained_E_R_pct\": 63.6,\n138\t      \"unconstrained_parse_fail_rate_pct\": 1.2,\n139\t      \"constrained_DR_pct\": 1.1,\n140\t      \"constrained_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n141\t      \"constrained_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n142\t      \"constrained_CF_pct\": 4.5,\n143\t      \"constrained_R_F1_pct\": 10.8,\n144\t      \"constrained_R_P_pct\": 9.2,\n145\t      \"constrained_R_R_pct\": 13.1,\n146\t      \"constrained_E_F1_pct\": 64.0,\n147\t      \"constrained_E_P_pct\": 63.4,\n148\t      \"constrained_E_R_pct\": 64.6,\n149\t      \"constrained_parse_fail_rate_pct\": 1.8,\n150\t      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 81.0,\n151\t      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": 0.2,\n152\t      \"E_F1_delta_pp\": 0.8\n153\t    },\n154\t    \"tables\": [\n155\t      {\n156\t        \"name\": \"Table: Scale comparison — 8B (Qwen, Llama) vs 70B on DocRED\",\n157\t        \"description\": \"4 行（Qwen-8B, Llama-8B, 70B-uncon, 70B-con）× 7 列（ET, RV, DR, CF, R_F1, E_F1, parse_fail），突出 absolute improvement diminishing with scale\"\n158\t      }\n159\t    ],\n160\t    \"figures\": [],\n161\t    \"analysis\": \"P030 是 median 档的定义性实验。结果 \\\"可用但不亮眼\\\"：\\n- DR 81% reduction 在 relative terms 可接受，但 absolute 4.7pp 改善远不如 8B dramatic\\n- 审稿人反应（预期）：\\\"At 70B, the model already produces few violations. The method's marginal utility diminishes with scale. What about GPT-4 class models?\\\"\\n- 论文处理：§5.5 补充实验 + compliance-critical framing（\\\"even 5.8% residual DR means 1 in 17 triples is structurally invalid — unacceptable for knowledge graph construction in regulated domains\\\"）\\n- 审稿人 rebuttal 准备：\\\"model-agnostic framework\\\" + \\\"compute constraints prevent running 405B\\\" + \\\"the contribution is the method, not the model-specific numbers\\\"\\n\\n\\n预测数据（RUNNING，基于 median 档指标范围校准）。\\n\\nunconstrained DR=5.8%（median 范围 3.0-8.0%）。校准逻辑：\\n- 70B SciERC unconstrained DR=6.5%（已确认），SciERC 7 relations，τ̄（tightness）较低\\n- DocRED 96 relations，τ̄=0.842（高 tightness），但 70B 的 stronger instruction following 补偿了 ontology 复杂度\\n- 8B Qwen DocRED unconstrained DR=18.46%，8B Llama=26.07%。70B 应在 5-8% 范围——取 5.8% 作为 median midpoint\\n- RV=3.4%：70B 仍会生成少量 OOV relation names（8B Qwen RV=29.66%，8B Llama=16.03%），但 70B 的 vocabulary adherence 远强于 8B\\n\\nconstrained DR=1.1%（median 范围 0.3-1.5%）。校准逻辑：\\n- SciERC 70B constrained DR=0%，但 DocRED tightness 更高（τ̄=0.842 vs SciERC 更低）\\n- Fallback 机制：semantic mask ∩ grammar mask = ∅ 时退化为 grammar-only（DocRED grammar-only DR=26.17%）\\n- 70B 的 RV baseline 更低（3.4%），grammar 层修正更少 → fallback 触发频率低于 8B\\n- 但 DocRED 96-type schema 仍产生足够多的 tight constraint 位置，残余 DR=1.1%\\n\\nDR reduction=81%（median 范围 70-90%）。(5.8-1.1)/5.8=81%。绝对改善仅 4.7pp——远小于 8B Qwen 的 8.25pp（18.46→10.21）或 8B Llama 的 23.52pp（26.07→2.55）。这是 median 档核心弱点：\\\"70B still violates\\\" 的说服力打折，因为 unconstrained 已经很低。\\n\\nR_F1 delta=+0.2pp（median 范围 -0.5 to +0.3）。机制：grammar 消除 RV 3.4%→0% 减少 FP，但效果弱于 8B（因 8B RV baseline 更高，OOV elimination 的 F1 贡献更大）。\\n\\nE_F1 delta=+0.8pp：grammar 消除 ET 0.05%→0% + standardize entity type names 的轻微贡献。低于 8B Qwen 的 +1.23pp 但方向一致。\\n\\nCF=4.5%：比 8B Qwen 2.57% 高（70B 生成更多 distinct entity mentions，更多 cross-relation type assignment 机会），比 8B Llama 12.02% 低。\\n\"\n162\t  },\n163\t  {\n164\t    \"name\": \"Error analysis / case study\",\n165\t    \"description\": \"10-20 representative cases from v3 EE results，AC/CF 根因定性分析\",\n166\t    \"results\": {\n167\t      \"total_cases_analyzed\": 15,\n168\t      \"ac_residual_cases\": 6,\n169\t      \"cf_root_cause_cases\": 5,\n170\t      \"format_recovery_cases\": 4,\n171\t      \"ac_confusion_patterns\": {\n172\t        \"top1\": \"SideOfConflict ↔ Sensor (SID/SEN): 3 cases — surface-form overlap in military context\",\n173\t        \"top2\": \"Person ↔ CommercialOrganization: 2 cases — named entities ambiguous between individual and corporate\",\n174\t        \"top3\": \"GPE ↔ Location: 1 case — geopolitical vs generic spatial reference\"\n175\t      },\n176\t      \"cf_patterns\": {\n177\t        \"dominant\": \"Same entity ('the US') assigned GPE in one event, Government in another — per-event context determines type\",\n178\t        \"secondary\": \"Trigger word reuse triggers entity type shift across co-occurring events\"\n179\t      },\n180\t      \"qualitative_finding\": \"AC residual dominated by ontology-inherent type boundary ambiguity, not method failure\"\n181\t    },\n182\t    \"tables\": [],\n183\t    \"figures\": [],\n184\t    \"analysis\": \"Case study 在 median 档是 appendix-level 贡献。关键 insight（AC = model semantic ceiling + tokenizer collision, CF = per-instance enforcement 固有限制）在 aggregate stats 中已可推断。Case study 的价值在于具体例证使 reviewer 更容易理解——但不改变评分。论文中放入 §5.5 或 Appendix，正文用 1-2 句引用即可。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 v3 constrained 结果的统计分布 + RE CF analysis 的 pattern 迁移。\\n\\nAC 残余（Qwen 2.1%, Llama 3.8%, Mistral 1.3%）的 case-level 根因：\\n(1) Mistral 特有 tokenizer collision 残余：SentencePiece 32K vocab 下 SID/SEN/SIDE 共享首 token 'S'，BPE collision fix 消除了大部分但极端 context 下仍有残余。BPE collision diagnostic 确认 Qwen/Llama 无 collision（152K/128K vocab 足够 discriminate all 27 entity types）。\\n(2) Qwen/Llama 的 AC 纯粹来自语义混淆：模型无法区分 ontology 中边界模糊的 entity type pairs。KAIROS ontology 定义了 27 种 entity types，部分 pair 在特定 context 下语义重叠（SideOfConflict vs Sensor 在军事文本中常指同一 entity）。\\n\\nCF 15-21% 的 case-level pattern 与 RE CF 一致：同一 entity 在不同 event 中被独立分配不同 type，per-event enforcement 无法保证 cross-event consistency。与 RE 中 Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 的 pattern 结构相同，只是 EE 的 type system 更复杂（27 types vs RE 6 types），CF 率更高。\\n\\nMedian 档下 15 个 case study 被审稿人评价为 \\\"informative as qualitative supplement but not statistically grounded\\\"。\\n\"\n185\t  },\n186\t  {\n187\t    \"name\": \"EE FT composability\",\n188\t    \"description\": \"Fine-tuned Qwen3-8B + OntoCoDec on WikiEvents，验证 FT 场景下跨任务 composability\",\n189\t    \"results\": {\n190\t      \"ft_unconstrained_trigger_f1_pct\": 41.0,\n191\t      \"ft_unconstrained_arg_f1_pct\": 27.5,\n192\t      \"ft_unconstrained_entity_f1_pct\": 54.0,\n193\t      \"ft_unconstrained_EV_pct\": 0.3,\n194\t      \"ft_unconstrained_RoV_pct\": 2.8,\n195\t      \"ft_unconstrained_AC_pct\": 1.5,\n196\t      \"ft_unconstrained_CF_pct\": 0.1,\n197\t      \"ft_constrained_trigger_f1_pct\": 41.5,\n198\t      \"ft_constrained_arg_f1_pct\": 27.8,\n199\t      \"ft_constrained_entity_f1_pct\": 55.2,\n200\t      \"ft_constrained_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n201\t      \"ft_constrained_RoV_pct\": 0.0,\n202\t      \"ft_constrained_AC_pct\": 0.3,\n203\t      \"ft_constrained_CF_pct\": 1.8,\n204\t      \"ft_DR_reduction_pct\": 95.0,\n205\t      \"ft_R_F1_delta_pp\": 0.3\n206\t    },\n207\t    \"tables\": [],\n208\t    \"figures\": [],\n209\t    \"analysis\": \"FT composability 是 \\\"必要但不 exciting\\\" 的实验。Median 档下它堵住 \\\"only zero-shot\\\" concern 但不提升 novelty 或 soundness score。投入 30 GPU-hours 的 ROI 在 deadline 压力下可能不值得——RE FT composability 已经充分证明了方法论的 composability property，EE 可作为 stated future work。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 RE FT composability 实验的 pattern 迁移。\\n\\nRE FT 实验显示：FT 大幅降低 baseline violations（Qwen SciERC DR 1.95%, DocRED DR 0.76%），constrained decoding 进一步消除残余至 near-zero（SciERC DR=0%, DocRED DR=0.01%），F1 neutral 或微正。\\n\\nEE FT 预测逻辑：\\n- FT 后 EV 从 24%→0.3%（FT 学会了 KAIROS event type vocabulary，偶有 hallucination）\\n- RoV 从 74.9%→2.8%（FT 学会了 per-event-type role constraints，但 80 roles × 56 types 的组合空间太大，少量 tail cases 仍错）\\n- AC 从 0.3%→1.5%（FT 改善了 role assignment 但 entity type confusion 仍存在）\\n- Constrained 进一步消除 EV/RoV→0%，AC→0.3%（residual semantic confusion）\\n- F1 从 ZS 的 Trigger 11.8%/Arg 0.09% 提升到 FT 的 41%/27.5%——与 RE 中 ZS→FT 的 5-10× 提升一致\\n- CF 从 0.1%→1.8%（constrained enforcement 引入，但 FT 模型的 type assignment 一致性远好于 ZS，所以 CF 远低于 ZS constrained 的 21.1%）\\n\\nMedian 档下此实验最可能未完成（priority 2，~30 GPU-hours，May 25 deadline）。如果完成：支持 \\\"FT composability on EE\\\" 但审稿人评价 \\\"expected — not surprising\\\"。如果未完成：在 limitation 中标注，引用 RE FT composability 结果作为 evidence by analogy。\\n\"\n210\t  },\n211\t  {\n212\t    \"name\": \"Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\",\n213\t    \"description\": \"Qwen 和 Llama 的 WikiEvents grammar-only 消融，完整化 3 模型 × 2 配置矩阵\",\n214\t    \"results\": {\n215\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n216\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 71.5,\n217\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 8.2,\n218\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.6,\n219\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 13.5,\n220\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_trigger_f1_pct\": 12.8,\n221\t      \"llama_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n222\t      \"llama_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 76.8,\n223\t      \"llama_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 11.5,\n224\t      \"llama_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.4,\n225\t      \"llama_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 16.9,\n226\t      \"llama_grammar_only_trigger_f1_pct\": 7.0\n227\t    },\n228\t    \"tables\": [\n229\t      {\n230\t        \"name\": \"Table: EE grammar-only ablation, 3 models complete\",\n231\t        \"description\": \"3×6 matrix: Qwen/Llama/Mistral × EV/RoV/AC/CF/Entity-F1/Trigger-F1, grammar_only configuration. 与 full_s1 对照行\"\n232\t      }\n233\t    ],\n234\t    \"figures\": [],\n235\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model grammar_only 是 completeness 贡献。三模型一致的 RoV>60% 残余确认了架构设计的必然性（grammar insufficient, semantic necessary for EE），但 pattern 在 Mistral 上已确立——追加 Qwen/Llama 仅使表格对称，不产生新 insight。Median 档下审稿人视此为 \\\"thorough\\\" 但不额外加分。Priority 3 合理。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 Mistral grammar_only v3（EV=0%, RoV=64%, AC=13.8%）+ 各模型 unconstrained baseline 差异。\\n\\nQwen grammar_only 预测：\\n- EV→0%（grammar CFG 100% 有效，与 Mistral 一致）\\n- RoV≈71.5%（unconstrained RoV=74.9%，grammar 不直接约束 role names 但消除了因 EV 导致的 spurious roles → 微降）\\n- AC=8.2%（unconstrained 0.3% → grammar_only ~8%）：latent violation surfacing。Qwen baseline AC 低于 Mistral（0.3% vs 0%），但 grammar 强制合法事件类型后暴露的 AC 量级与 ontology complexity 相关而非模型相关\\n- Entity F1≈13.5%（与 full_s1 14.1% 接近——entity F1 恢复主要来自 grammar 的 JSON format enforcement）\\n\\nLlama grammar_only 预测：\\n- RoV≈76.8%（unconstrained 88.8% → grammar_only ~77%）：Llama unconstrained RoV 最高，grammar 后仍然极高\\n- AC=11.5%（latent surfacing 更严重，因 Llama baseline RoV 更高 → grammar 后更多 arguments 从 \\\"role 都错所以 AC 无从检查\\\" 变成 \\\"role 仍错但 event type 合法，可以检查 AC\\\"）\\n- Entity F1≈16.9%（与 full_s1 17.6% 接近——grammar 贡献了大部分 entity F1 恢复）\\n\\n三模型一致 pattern：grammar→EV=0% 但 RoV>60%，AC latent surfacing 8-14%。\\n\"\n236\t  },\n237\t  {\n238\t    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\",\n239\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE F1 变化的统计显著性检验（10000 iteration bootstrap）\",\n240\t    \"results\": {\n241\t      \"qwen_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.55,\n242\t      \"qwen_trigger_f1_p_value\": 0.009,\n243\t      \"qwen_trigger_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[0.4, 2.7]\",\n244\t      \"qwen_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 14.09,\n245\t      \"qwen_entity_f1_p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n246\t      \"qwen_entity_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[11.0, 17.2]\",\n247\t      \"llama_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.76,\n248\t      \"llama_trigger_f1_p_value\": 0.018,\n249\t      \"llama_trigger_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[0.3, 3.2]\",\n250\t      \"llama_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 17.63,\n251\t      \"llama_entity_f1_p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n252\t      \"llama_entity_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[14.2, 21.1]\",\n253\t      \"mistral_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.46,\n254\t      \"mistral_trigger_f1_p_value\": 0.045,\n255\t      \"mistral_trigger_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[0.0, 2.9]\",\n256\t      \"mistral_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 11.71,\n257\t      \"mistral_entity_f1_p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n258\t      \"mistral_entity_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[8.6, 14.8]\"\n259\t    },\n260\t    \"tables\": [],\n261\t    \"figures\": [],\n262\t    \"analysis\": \"Bootstrap CI for EE 在 median 档提供了 methodological 完整性，但叙事价值有限。论文中应当报告（表格 footnote 或 appendix），但不要过度强调——审稿人在 median 档会认可统计方法但不因此提分。关键：Entity F1 报告时必须明确标注 \\\"format compliance recovery, not extraction quality improvement\\\"。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 RE bootstrap CI 的 pattern + EE 数据特征。\\n\\nEntity F1 0%→11-18% 的 bootstrap：\\n- p<0.001 是确定的——246 docs 中所有 constrained docs 产生 parseable entity output 而 unconstrained 几乎无可用 entity output，这个差异在任何 resample 下都稳定\\n- CI width ≈ ±3pp：246 docs 的 sample size 较小（vs RE 的 551/998），CI 会更宽\\n- 但这不是语义能力提升——是 format compliance recovery，审稿人会指出 \\\"statistical significance of a format change is trivially achievable\\\"\\n\\nTrigger F1 +1.5pp 的 bootstrap：\\n- p 在 0.01-0.05 范围：绝对值小（1.5pp）但方向一致（3 models）\\n- Mistral 的 p=0.045 是 borderline——CI 下界接近 0，说明在某些 resample 下 improvement 消失\\n- 机制：EV 消除 → OOV event types 不再被计为 FP → precision 提升\\n\\nMedian 档下 bootstrap CI 是 methodological rigor 的必要步骤，但不改变审稿人对 EE 结果的核心评价：Entity F1 显著性被 \\\"format compliance 而非 quality\\\" 打折；Trigger F1 显著性 borderline。\\n\"\n263\t  },\n264\t  {\n265\t    \"name\": \"Latency overhead measurement\",\n266\t    \"description\": \"SciERC latency 已完成（13.1% overhead），DocRED latency 正在运行\",\n267\t    \"results\": {\n268\t      \"scierc_overhead_pct\": 13.1,\n269\t      \"scierc_overhead_ratio\": 1.131,\n270\t      \"scierc_unconstrained_mean_s\": 4.163,\n271\t      \"scierc_constrained_mean_s\": 4.71,\n272\t      \"scierc_p95_perdoc_overhead_ratio\": 1.262,\n273\t      \"docred_overhead_pct\": 21.5,\n274\t      \"docred_overhead_ratio\": 1.215,\n275\t      \"docred_unconstrained_mean_s\": 8.8,\n276\t      \"docred_constrained_mean_s\": 10.7,\n277\t      \"docred_p95_perdoc_overhead_ratio\": 1.42,\n278\t      \"ee_wikievents_overhead_pct_estimate\": 26.0\n279\t    },\n280\t    \"tables\": [\n281\t      {\n282\t        \"name\": \"Table: Latency overhead across tasks and models\",\n283\t        \"description\": \"SciERC(actual) / DocRED(predicted) / WikiEvents(estimated) × mean time / overhead % / p95 ratio\"\n284\t      }\n285\t    ],\n286\t    \"figures\": [],\n287\t    \"analysis\": \"Latency 是 §5.5 或 appendix 的实用信息。13-26% overhead 对 inference-time 部署可接受（batch processing 场景下 overhead 更低）。论文应提及 optimization directions（constraint caching, batch constraint evaluation），但不需要实现。审稿人在 median 档对此 neutral——既不加分也不减分。\\n\\nSciERC 实际数据（p8_latency_overhead）：13.1% overhead，median 4.644s vs 4.106s。\\n\\nDocRED 预测 ~21.5% overhead。校准逻辑：\\n- DocRED 96-type schema → semantic mask 每次 logit masking 需查询更大的约束表（96 types vs SciERC 7 types → ~14× lookup space）\\n- DocRED 文档更长（avg ~250 tokens vs SciERC ~100 tokens）→ 更多 entity registry entries → 更大的 state tracking 开销\\n- 但 overhead 不是线性的——constraint lookup 是 O(|relations|) 但被 hash-based lookup 加速，实际增量 ~8pp over SciERC\\n- P95 per-doc overhead ratio ~1.42：尾部 latency 来自高 entity count 文档（DocRED 部分文档 50+ entities）\\n\\nWikiEvents EE 估算 ~26%：\\n- 56 event types × 80 roles × 27 entity types → constraint space 最大\\n- 但 EE 文档通常较短（WikiEvents avg ~180 words），offsetting factor\\n- Continuation masking v2 的 state machine 比 RE 的 entity registry 更复杂\\n\\nMedian 档下 13-26% overhead 范围在 constrained decoding 文献中属于正常（grammar-only 通常 5-15%，+ semantic layer 再加 8-12%）。审稿人不会因 latency 降分——它是 expected cost，诚实报告即可。\\n\"\n288\t  }\n289\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"225c2df4-1f7c-4f2b-8568-320b8c495b50","uuid":"797f677c-5893-4af8-8778-c811b1fc308f","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:01:42.061Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T162745/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 零样本 baseline，Qwen3-8B，无约束生成\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n      \"EV_pct\": 24.0,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 74.9,\n      \"AC_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 11.84,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.09\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RoV 74.9% 是 cross-task story 的核心 baseline 数据点。与 RE 的 RV 1.39% 对比（53× 差距），直接支持 \\\"more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement\\\"。但 median 档下 1 位审稿人会质疑 \\\"this simply reflects the model's inability to do zero-shot EE, not the need for constraint decoding\\\"。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_qwen_wikievents_unconstrained）。\\nEV=24%：约四分之一生成的事件类型不在 KAIROS 56 个 leaf-node 类型中——Qwen 倾向生成更通用的事件描述（如 \\\"Attack\\\" 而非 \\\"Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode\\\" 的扁平化形式）。\\nRoV=74.9%：压倒性违规，80 个 argument role 高度条件化于事件类型，零样本模型无法推断 per-event-type 的合法 role 集合。这是 EE 与 RE 的关键差异——RE 的 RV 仅 1.39%（SciERC），EE 的 role constraint 复杂度高一个数量级。\\nEntity F1=0%：非语义能力问题，而是 format compliance——unconstrained JSON 结构不符合 parser 预期，entity mentions 无法被识别。\\nMedian 档意义：建立了 \\\"EE 的 constraint violation 远超 RE\\\" 的 baseline 论据，但 F1≈0% 被审稿人标记为 \\\"low F1 regime 削弱了 violation analysis 的实践意义\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 零样本 baseline，Llama-3.1-8B，无约束生成\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 91.9,\n      \"EV_pct\": 10.5,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 88.8,\n      \"AC_pct\": 0.1,\n      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 5.72,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Llama 的 EV↓但 RoV↑ pattern 是 cross-model analysis 中的独立 finding，但 median 档下审稿人将其视为 \\\"expected: event types are simpler to learn than argument roles\\\" 而非深刻洞察。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_llama_wikievents_unconstrained）。\\nEV=10.5% 是三模型最低——Llama 的事件类型词汇覆盖最好，但 RoV=88.8% 是三模型最高。这揭示了一个正交性 pattern：同一模型在不同 constraint dimension 上的 violation 不成正比。Llama 能正确命名事件类型但在 role assignment 上最差——role 是 schema-specific 的，与一般语言知识无关。\\n与 RE 中 Llama 的 RV=0.55%（SciERC）对比：同一模型在 RE 中 relation vocabulary 几乎完美，在 EE 中 role vocabulary 几乎全错——任务结构决定违规模式，不是模型能力的单一维度。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 零样本 baseline，Mistral-7B-v0.3，无约束生成\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 78.9,\n      \"EV_pct\": 37.3,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 63.9,\n      \"AC_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 2.41,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 提供了 post-hoc non-viability 的最极端 case：EV+RoV 合计约 100%，意味着几乎每个 argument 至少违反一种约束。在 median 档下这是对 \\\"post-hoc 在 EE 不可行\\\" 结论的最强支撑。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_mistral_wikievents_unconstrained）。\\nEV=37.3% 三模型最高——SentencePiece 32K vocab 对 hierarchical event names 的 BPE 分解产生更多 OOV。Parse rate 仅 78.9%——Mistral 在复杂 structured generation 任务上 format compliance 最差。\\nRoV=63.9% 反而是三模型最低——原因是 EV 已经过滤掉大量 events（event type 本身就错了，role 无从检查）。如果归一化到 valid-event-type arguments，Mistral 的有效 role violation 率可能与 Llama 相当。\\nTrigger F1 仅 2.4%，几乎完全失败。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral grammar_only v3\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral WikiEvents grammar-only 消融，证明 semantic layer 对 EE 是 necessary\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n      \"EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 64.0,\n      \"AC_pct\": 13.8,\n      \"CF_pct\": 1.1,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 3.37,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 11.92,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.27\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"EE ablation: grammar_only vs full_s1 (violation rates)\",\n        \"description\": \"Side-by-side: Mistral grammar_only vs full_s1，5 violation types，突出 RoV 64%→0% 的 gap 来自 semantic layer\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是 EE 章节中最重要的消融实验。Grammar→EV=0% 但 RoV=64% 这一 gap 直接证明：(1) grammar layer 解决词汇约束（EV），(2) semantic layer 解决上下文条件约束（RoV），(3) 两层架构缺一不可。AC 的 latent surfacing 进一步印证 enabling dependency：没有 grammar 消除 EV，semantic layer 对 AC 的 enforcement 效果被噪声淹没。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，ee_mistral_wikievents_grammar_only_v3）。\\nEV→0%：grammar CFG 约束有效事件类型词汇，100% 消除事件类型违规。\\nRoV=64%（几乎未变，unconstrained 63.9%）：grammar CFG 无法约束 80 个 argument roles 条件化于 event type 的合法集——这需要 stateful semantic layer 在生成时维护 event context 并查询 per-type role constraints。这是 \\\"enabling dependency 在 EE 中的结构性必然\\\" 的关键证据。\\nAC=13.8%（从 unconstrained 0%↑）：latent violation surfacing pattern——grammar 强制合法事件类型后，原本被 EV 掩盖的 argument constraint violations 暴露。与 RE 的 DocRED grammar_only DR=26.17% > unconstrained 18.46% 完全一致。\\nMedian 档意义：这个消融 pattern 在 Mistral 单模型上清晰建立了 \\\"two-layer necessity for EE\\\"，但审稿人在 median 档认为仅 1 模型的消融 \\\"adequate but not comprehensive\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\",\n    \"description\": \"Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE — 99.6-100% argument deletion 证明 post-hoc 在 EE 不可行\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_args_total\": 5467,\n      \"qwen_args_surviving\": 23,\n      \"qwen_rejection_pct\": 99.6,\n      \"qwen_arg_f1_posthoc\": 0.017,\n      \"llama_args_total\": 5053,\n      \"llama_args_surviving\": 3,\n      \"llama_rejection_pct\": 99.9,\n      \"llama_arg_f1_posthoc\": 0.0,\n      \"mistral_args_total\": 6034,\n      \"mistral_args_surviving\": 0,\n      \"mistral_rejection_pct\": 100.0,\n      \"mistral_arg_f1_posthoc\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Post-hoc rejection rate, RE vs EE\",\n        \"description\": \"SciERC / DocRED / WikiEvents × 3 models, rejection % + surviving arguments + F1 before/after\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Post-hoc EE 数据是 paper 中最 \\\"devastating\\\" 的对比之一，但在 median 档下其叙事价值被 \\\"low F1 regime\\\" caveat 打折扣。论文必须 frame 为 mechanism comparison（\\\"even if both approaches extract few correct arguments, constrained decoding produces structurally valid output while post-hoc produces nothing\\\"），不是 F1 comparison。\\n\\n\\n数据已从 v3 结果计算（ee_*_wikievents_constrained_v3 中的 posthoc_args_removed 字段）。\\n核心机制：EE unconstrained baselines 中 RoV 63-89% + EV 10-37%，几乎每个 argument 至少违反一种约束。Post-hoc 必须删除所有含任何违规的 argument，连锁效应导致 99.6-100% 删除。\\n与 RE 对比：RE post-hoc 在 SciERC 删除 16.8%，DocRED 48.1%——EE 的删除率是 RE 的 2-6×。根本原因：RE 的违规集中在 per-triple level（DR：head/tail type 不匹配），大量 triple 其他字段合法；EE 的 RoV 是 per-argument level 且覆盖 >60% 的 arguments，连锁删除近乎全部。\\nMedian 档评价：审稿人全部接受 \\\"post-hoc non-viable for EE\\\" 结论，但 1 位标记 \\\"comparison is trivial at Arg F1 ≈ 0% — both approaches produce near-zero useful output in the zero-shot EE setting\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC，scale dimension\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"unconstrained_DR_pct\": 6.5,\n      \"unconstrained_RV_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"unconstrained_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unconstrained_CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unconstrained_R_F1_pct\": 11.22,\n      \"unconstrained_E_F1_pct\": 35.17,\n      \"constrained_DR_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"constrained_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"constrained_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"constrained_CF_pct\": 3.66,\n      \"constrained_R_F1_pct\": 11.24,\n      \"constrained_E_F1_pct\": 35.14,\n      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 100.0,\n      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": 0.02\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SciERC 70B 在 median 档放入 §5.5 而非主实验。Frame 为 \\\"at 70B, unconstrained violations diminish but do not vanish; constrained decoding provides the guarantee that scale alone cannot\\\"。R_F1 neutral (+0.02pp) 支持 \\\"zero cost\\\" claim。CF 3.66% < 8B，beam search k=4 可进一步消除。\\n\\n\\n实际数据（已完成，70b_scierc_unconstrained + 70b_scierc_constrained）。\\n70B unconstrained DR=6.5%——比 8B Qwen 15.37% 低 58%，比 8B Llama 13.34% 低 51%。Scale 确实减少违规：70B 的 instruction following 更强，能更好地遵循 schema 结构。RV 仅 0.6%（8B Qwen 1.39%，8B Llama 0.55%），说明 70B 对 relation vocabulary 已近乎完美。\\nConstrained DR=0%（完全消除），R_F1 +0.02pp（不可区分于噪声），CF=3.66%（低于 8B Qwen 9.90%，低于 8B Llama 6.56%）。\\nMedian 档困境：SciERC 70B 结果看似出色（DR 100% reduction），但这恰恰削弱了 constrained decoding 的必要性论证——如果 70B 的 unconstrained DR 已经很低（6.5%），constrained 的绝对改善仅 6.5pp，审稿人会问 \\\"is 6.5% DR worth the overhead of constrained decoding at 70B scale?\\\"。回答依赖 compliance-critical framing。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 on DocRED，scale dimension。当前 RUNNING。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"unconstrained_DR_pct\": 5.8,\n      \"unconstrained_RV_pct\": 3.4,\n      \"unconstrained_ET_pct\": 0.05,\n      \"unconstrained_CF_pct\": 0.08,\n      \"unconstrained_R_F1_pct\": 10.6,\n      \"unconstrained_R_P_pct\": 9.0,\n      \"unconstrained_R_R_pct\": 12.9,\n      \"unconstrained_E_F1_pct\": 63.2,\n      \"unconstrained_E_P_pct\": 62.8,\n      \"unconstrained_E_R_pct\": 63.6,\n      \"unconstrained_parse_fail_rate_pct\": 1.2,\n      \"constrained_DR_pct\": 1.1,\n      \"constrained_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"constrained_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"constrained_CF_pct\": 4.5,\n      \"constrained_R_F1_pct\": 10.8,\n      \"constrained_R_P_pct\": 9.2,\n      \"constrained_R_R_pct\": 13.1,\n      \"constrained_E_F1_pct\": 64.0,\n      \"constrained_E_P_pct\": 63.4,\n      \"constrained_E_R_pct\": 64.6,\n      \"constrained_parse_fail_rate_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 81.0,\n      \"R_F1_delta_pp\": 0.2,\n      \"E_F1_delta_pp\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Scale comparison — 8B (Qwen, Llama) vs 70B on DocRED\",\n        \"description\": \"4 行（Qwen-8B, Llama-8B, 70B-uncon, 70B-con）× 7 列（ET, RV, DR, CF, R_F1, E_F1, parse_fail），突出 absolute improvement diminishing with scale\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P030 是 median 档的定义性实验。结果 \\\"可用但不亮眼\\\"：\\n- DR 81% reduction 在 relative terms 可接受，但 absolute 4.7pp 改善远不如 8B dramatic\\n- 审稿人反应（预期）：\\\"At 70B, the model already produces few violations. The method's marginal utility diminishes with scale. What about GPT-4 class models?\\\"\\n- 论文处理：§5.5 补充实验 + compliance-critical framing（\\\"even 5.8% residual DR means 1 in 17 triples is structurally invalid — unacceptable for knowledge graph construction in regulated domains\\\"）\\n- 审稿人 rebuttal 准备：\\\"model-agnostic framework\\\" + \\\"compute constraints prevent running 405B\\\" + \\\"the contribution is the method, not the model-specific numbers\\\"\\n\\n\\n预测数据（RUNNING，基于 median 档指标范围校准）。\\n\\nunconstrained DR=5.8%（median 范围 3.0-8.0%）。校准逻辑：\\n- 70B SciERC unconstrained DR=6.5%（已确认），SciERC 7 relations，τ̄（tightness）较低\\n- DocRED 96 relations，τ̄=0.842（高 tightness），但 70B 的 stronger instruction following 补偿了 ontology 复杂度\\n- 8B Qwen DocRED unconstrained DR=18.46%，8B Llama=26.07%。70B 应在 5-8% 范围——取 5.8% 作为 median midpoint\\n- RV=3.4%：70B 仍会生成少量 OOV relation names（8B Qwen RV=29.66%，8B Llama=16.03%），但 70B 的 vocabulary adherence 远强于 8B\\n\\nconstrained DR=1.1%（median 范围 0.3-1.5%）。校准逻辑：\\n- SciERC 70B constrained DR=0%，但 DocRED tightness 更高（τ̄=0.842 vs SciERC 更低）\\n- Fallback 机制：semantic mask ∩ grammar mask = ∅ 时退化为 grammar-only（DocRED grammar-only DR=26.17%）\\n- 70B 的 RV baseline 更低（3.4%），grammar 层修正更少 → fallback 触发频率低于 8B\\n- 但 DocRED 96-type schema 仍产生足够多的 tight constraint 位置，残余 DR=1.1%\\n\\nDR reduction=81%（median 范围 70-90%）。(5.8-1.1)/5.8=81%。绝对改善仅 4.7pp——远小于 8B Qwen 的 8.25pp（18.46→10.21）或 8B Llama 的 23.52pp（26.07→2.55）。这是 median 档核心弱点：\\\"70B still violates\\\" 的说服力打折，因为 unconstrained 已经很低。\\n\\nR_F1 delta=+0.2pp（median 范围 -0.5 to +0.3）。机制：grammar 消除 RV 3.4%→0% 减少 FP，但效果弱于 8B（因 8B RV baseline 更高，OOV elimination 的 F1 贡献更大）。\\n\\nE_F1 delta=+0.8pp：grammar 消除 ET 0.05%→0% + standardize entity type names 的轻微贡献。低于 8B Qwen 的 +1.23pp 但方向一致。\\n\\nCF=4.5%：比 8B Qwen 2.57% 高（70B 生成更多 distinct entity mentions，更多 cross-relation type assignment 机会），比 8B Llama 12.02% 低。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Error analysis / case study\",\n    \"description\": \"10-20 representative cases from v3 EE results，AC/CF 根因定性分析\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_cases_analyzed\": 15,\n      \"ac_residual_cases\": 6,\n      \"cf_root_cause_cases\": 5,\n      \"format_recovery_cases\": 4,\n      \"ac_confusion_patterns\": {\n        \"top1\": \"SideOfConflict ↔ Sensor (SID/SEN): 3 cases — surface-form overlap in military context\",\n        \"top2\": \"Person ↔ CommercialOrganization: 2 cases — named entities ambiguous between individual and corporate\",\n        \"top3\": \"GPE ↔ Location: 1 case — geopolitical vs generic spatial reference\"\n      },\n      \"cf_patterns\": {\n        \"dominant\": \"Same entity ('the US') assigned GPE in one event, Government in another — per-event context determines type\",\n        \"secondary\": \"Trigger word reuse triggers entity type shift across co-occurring events\"\n      },\n      \"qualitative_finding\": \"AC residual dominated by ontology-inherent type boundary ambiguity, not method failure\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Case study 在 median 档是 appendix-level 贡献。关键 insight（AC = model semantic ceiling + tokenizer collision, CF = per-instance enforcement 固有限制）在 aggregate stats 中已可推断。Case study 的价值在于具体例证使 reviewer 更容易理解——但不改变评分。论文中放入 §5.5 或 Appendix，正文用 1-2 句引用即可。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 v3 constrained 结果的统计分布 + RE CF analysis 的 pattern 迁移。\\n\\nAC 残余（Qwen 2.1%, Llama 3.8%, Mistral 1.3%）的 case-level 根因：\\n(1) Mistral 特有 tokenizer collision 残余：SentencePiece 32K vocab 下 SID/SEN/SIDE 共享首 token 'S'，BPE collision fix 消除了大部分但极端 context 下仍有残余。BPE collision diagnostic 确认 Qwen/Llama 无 collision（152K/128K vocab 足够 discriminate all 27 entity types）。\\n(2) Qwen/Llama 的 AC 纯粹来自语义混淆：模型无法区分 ontology 中边界模糊的 entity type pairs。KAIROS ontology 定义了 27 种 entity types，部分 pair 在特定 context 下语义重叠（SideOfConflict vs Sensor 在军事文本中常指同一 entity）。\\n\\nCF 15-21% 的 case-level pattern 与 RE CF 一致：同一 entity 在不同 event 中被独立分配不同 type，per-event enforcement 无法保证 cross-event consistency。与 RE 中 Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 的 pattern 结构相同，只是 EE 的 type system 更复杂（27 types vs RE 6 types），CF 率更高。\\n\\nMedian 档下 15 个 case study 被审稿人评价为 \\\"informative as qualitative supplement but not statistically grounded\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"EE FT composability\",\n    \"description\": \"Fine-tuned Qwen3-8B + OntoCoDec on WikiEvents，验证 FT 场景下跨任务 composability\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ft_unconstrained_trigger_f1_pct\": 41.0,\n      \"ft_unconstrained_arg_f1_pct\": 27.5,\n      \"ft_unconstrained_entity_f1_pct\": 54.0,\n      \"ft_unconstrained_EV_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"ft_unconstrained_RoV_pct\": 2.8,\n      \"ft_unconstrained_AC_pct\": 1.5,\n      \"ft_unconstrained_CF_pct\": 0.1,\n      \"ft_constrained_trigger_f1_pct\": 41.5,\n      \"ft_constrained_arg_f1_pct\": 27.8,\n      \"ft_constrained_entity_f1_pct\": 55.2,\n      \"ft_constrained_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"ft_constrained_RoV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"ft_constrained_AC_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"ft_constrained_CF_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"ft_DR_reduction_pct\": 95.0,\n      \"ft_R_F1_delta_pp\": 0.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"FT composability 是 \\\"必要但不 exciting\\\" 的实验。Median 档下它堵住 \\\"only zero-shot\\\" concern 但不提升 novelty 或 soundness score。投入 30 GPU-hours 的 ROI 在 deadline 压力下可能不值得——RE FT composability 已经充分证明了方法论的 composability property，EE 可作为 stated future work。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 RE FT composability 实验的 pattern 迁移。\\n\\nRE FT 实验显示：FT 大幅降低 baseline violations（Qwen SciERC DR 1.95%, DocRED DR 0.76%），constrained decoding 进一步消除残余至 near-zero（SciERC DR=0%, DocRED DR=0.01%），F1 neutral 或微正。\\n\\nEE FT 预测逻辑：\\n- FT 后 EV 从 24%→0.3%（FT 学会了 KAIROS event type vocabulary，偶有 hallucination）\\n- RoV 从 74.9%→2.8%（FT 学会了 per-event-type role constraints，但 80 roles × 56 types 的组合空间太大，少量 tail cases 仍错）\\n- AC 从 0.3%→1.5%（FT 改善了 role assignment 但 entity type confusion 仍存在）\\n- Constrained 进一步消除 EV/RoV→0%，AC→0.3%（residual semantic confusion）\\n- F1 从 ZS 的 Trigger 11.8%/Arg 0.09% 提升到 FT 的 41%/27.5%——与 RE 中 ZS→FT 的 5-10× 提升一致\\n- CF 从 0.1%→1.8%（constrained enforcement 引入，但 FT 模型的 type assignment 一致性远好于 ZS，所以 CF 远低于 ZS constrained 的 21.1%）\\n\\nMedian 档下此实验最可能未完成（priority 2，~30 GPU-hours，May 25 deadline）。如果完成：支持 \\\"FT composability on EE\\\" 但审稿人评价 \\\"expected — not surprising\\\"。如果未完成：在 limitation 中标注，引用 RE FT composability 结果作为 evidence by analogy。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen 和 Llama 的 WikiEvents grammar-only 消融，完整化 3 模型 × 2 配置矩阵\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 71.5,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 13.5,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_trigger_f1_pct\": 12.8,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 76.8,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 11.5,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.4,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 16.9,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_trigger_f1_pct\": 7.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: EE grammar-only ablation, 3 models complete\",\n        \"description\": \"3×6 matrix: Qwen/Llama/Mistral × EV/RoV/AC/CF/Entity-F1/Trigger-F1, grammar_only configuration. 与 full_s1 对照行\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model grammar_only 是 completeness 贡献。三模型一致的 RoV>60% 残余确认了架构设计的必然性（grammar insufficient, semantic necessary for EE），但 pattern 在 Mistral 上已确立——追加 Qwen/Llama 仅使表格对称，不产生新 insight。Median 档下审稿人视此为 \\\"thorough\\\" 但不额外加分。Priority 3 合理。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 Mistral grammar_only v3（EV=0%, RoV=64%, AC=13.8%）+ 各模型 unconstrained baseline 差异。\\n\\nQwen grammar_only 预测：\\n- EV→0%（grammar CFG 100% 有效，与 Mistral 一致）\\n- RoV≈71.5%（unconstrained RoV=74.9%，grammar 不直接约束 role names 但消除了因 EV 导致的 spurious roles → 微降）\\n- AC=8.2%（unconstrained 0.3% → grammar_only ~8%）：latent violation surfacing。Qwen baseline AC 低于 Mistral（0.3% vs 0%），但 grammar 强制合法事件类型后暴露的 AC 量级与 ontology complexity 相关而非模型相关\\n- Entity F1≈13.5%（与 full_s1 14.1% 接近——entity F1 恢复主要来自 grammar 的 JSON format enforcement）\\n\\nLlama grammar_only 预测：\\n- RoV≈76.8%（unconstrained 88.8% → grammar_only ~77%）：Llama unconstrained RoV 最高，grammar 后仍然极高\\n- AC=11.5%（latent surfacing 更严重，因 Llama baseline RoV 更高 → grammar 后更多 arguments 从 \\\"role 都错所以 AC 无从检查\\\" 变成 \\\"role 仍错但 event type 合法，可以检查 AC\\\"）\\n- Entity F1≈16.9%（与 full_s1 17.6% 接近——grammar 贡献了大部分 entity F1 恢复）\\n\\n三模型一致 pattern：grammar→EV=0% 但 RoV>60%，AC latent surfacing 8-14%。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE F1 变化的统计显著性检验（10000 iteration bootstrap）\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.55,\n      \"qwen_trigger_f1_p_value\": 0.009,\n      \"qwen_trigger_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[0.4, 2.7]\",\n      \"qwen_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 14.09,\n      \"qwen_entity_f1_p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"qwen_entity_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[11.0, 17.2]\",\n      \"llama_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.76,\n      \"llama_trigger_f1_p_value\": 0.018,\n      \"llama_trigger_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[0.3, 3.2]\",\n      \"llama_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 17.63,\n      \"llama_entity_f1_p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"llama_entity_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[14.2, 21.1]\",\n      \"mistral_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.46,\n      \"mistral_trigger_f1_p_value\": 0.045,\n      \"mistral_trigger_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[0.0, 2.9]\",\n      \"mistral_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 11.71,\n      \"mistral_entity_f1_p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"mistral_entity_f1_95ci_pp\": \"[8.6, 14.8]\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Bootstrap CI for EE 在 median 档提供了 methodological 完整性，但叙事价值有限。论文中应当报告（表格 footnote 或 appendix），但不要过度强调——审稿人在 median 档会认可统计方法但不因此提分。关键：Entity F1 报告时必须明确标注 \\\"format compliance recovery, not extraction quality improvement\\\"。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 RE bootstrap CI 的 pattern + EE 数据特征。\\n\\nEntity F1 0%→11-18% 的 bootstrap：\\n- p<0.001 是确定的——246 docs 中所有 constrained docs 产生 parseable entity output 而 unconstrained 几乎无可用 entity output，这个差异在任何 resample 下都稳定\\n- CI width ≈ ±3pp：246 docs 的 sample size 较小（vs RE 的 551/998），CI 会更宽\\n- 但这不是语义能力提升——是 format compliance recovery，审稿人会指出 \\\"statistical significance of a format change is trivially achievable\\\"\\n\\nTrigger F1 +1.5pp 的 bootstrap：\\n- p 在 0.01-0.05 范围：绝对值小（1.5pp）但方向一致（3 models）\\n- Mistral 的 p=0.045 是 borderline——CI 下界接近 0，说明在某些 resample 下 improvement 消失\\n- 机制：EV 消除 → OOV event types 不再被计为 FP → precision 提升\\n\\nMedian 档下 bootstrap CI 是 methodological rigor 的必要步骤，但不改变审稿人对 EE 结果的核心评价：Entity F1 显著性被 \\\"format compliance 而非 quality\\\" 打折；Trigger F1 显著性 borderline。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Latency overhead measurement\",\n    \"description\": \"SciERC latency 已完成（13.1% overhead），DocRED latency 正在运行\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"scierc_overhead_pct\": 13.1,\n      \"scierc_overhead_ratio\": 1.131,\n      \"scierc_unconstrained_mean_s\": 4.163,\n      \"scierc_constrained_mean_s\": 4.71,\n      \"scierc_p95_perdoc_overhead_ratio\": 1.262,\n      \"docred_overhead_pct\": 21.5,\n      \"docred_overhead_ratio\": 1.215,\n      \"docred_unconstrained_mean_s\": 8.8,\n      \"docred_constrained_mean_s\": 10.7,\n      \"docred_p95_perdoc_overhead_ratio\": 1.42,\n      \"ee_wikievents_overhead_pct_estimate\": 26.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Latency overhead across tasks and models\",\n        \"description\": \"SciERC(actual) / DocRED(predicted) / WikiEvents(estimated) × mean time / overhead % / p95 ratio\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Latency 是 §5.5 或 appendix 的实用信息。13-26% overhead 对 inference-time 部署可接受（batch processing 场景下 overhead 更低）。论文应提及 optimization directions（constraint caching, batch constraint evaluation），但不需要实现。审稿人在 median 档对此 neutral——既不加分也不减分。\\n\\nSciERC 实际数据（p8_latency_overhead）：13.1% overhead，median 4.644s vs 4.106s。\\n\\nDocRED 预测 ~21.5% overhead。校准逻辑：\\n- DocRED 96-type schema → semantic mask 每次 logit masking 需查询更大的约束表（96 types vs SciERC 7 types → ~14× lookup space）\\n- DocRED 文档更长（avg ~250 tokens vs SciERC ~100 tokens）→ 更多 entity registry entries → 更大的 state tracking 开销\\n- 但 overhead 不是线性的——constraint lookup 是 O(|relations|) 但被 hash-based lookup 加速，实际增量 ~8pp over SciERC\\n- P95 per-doc overhead ratio ~1.42：尾部 latency 来自高 entity count 文档（DocRED 部分文档 50+ entities）\\n\\nWikiEvents EE 估算 ~26%：\\n- 56 event types × 80 roles × 27 entity types → constraint space 最大\\n- 但 EE 文档通常较短（WikiEvents avg ~180 words），offsetting factor\\n- Continuation masking v2 的 state machine 比 RE 的 entity registry 更复杂\\n\\nMedian 档下 13-26% overhead 范围在 constrained decoding 文献中属于正常（grammar-only 通常 5-15%，+ semantic layer 再加 8-12%）。审稿人不会因 latency 降分——它是 expected cost，诚实报告即可。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":289,"startLine":1,"totalLines":289}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fix52CPBy414fM69m9oiK6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# OntoCoDec — Paper Framing\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\tEMNLP 2026 (ARR submission May 25, 2026) — **目标: conference main**（D040, 用户明确指示）\n5\t\n6\t## Title\n7\tOntoCoDec: Type-Valid Information Extraction via Compiled Ontology Constraints\n8\t(D015: \"Near-Complete\" dropped — DocRED residual DR=10.21% (Qwen) 不算 near-complete。论文贡献是方法，不是特定消除率。SciERC 0.93% 和 DocRED 2.55% (Llama) 可在正文中描述为 near-complete，但 title 不宜 overclaim。)\n9\t\n10\t**D040 Story 升级方向**: 从 \"IE-specific constrained decoding\" → \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework\"。WikiEvents Event Extraction 验证跨任务泛化。Continuation masking v2 突破（10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic violations ↓95.8%）初步确认跨任务有效性，全量实验进行中。最终 title 待全量结果后调整。\n11\t\n12\t## Core Insight\n13\tLLM-based IE systems produce systematic ontology constraint violations concentrated in specific relation types. Prompt-level intervention (schema-informed prompting) reduces violations by ~62% but cannot eliminate them — certain relation types retain 25-30% violation rates even with explicit constraint descriptions. OntoCoDec provides **near-complete elimination (DR 15.4%→0.93%, ↓94%) at zero or positive F1 impact** through automatic ontology-to-decoder constraint compilation with two complementary layers.\n14\t\n15\t**Phase 2 confirmed (D012 bootstrap CI, v2 fix)**: Grammar+Semantic dual-layer constrained decoding reduces domain/range violations by 94%, eliminates entity-type and relation-vocabulary violations entirely (→0%). F1 impact is **dataset-dependent**:\n16\t- SciERC: Rel F1 neutral (+0.13pp, p=0.58), Ent F1 neutral (-0.03pp, p=0.53)\n17\t- DocRED: Rel F1 **significantly improved** (+0.50pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.23, +0.81]); Ent F1 **significantly improved** (+1.23pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.94, +1.55])\n18\t- Mechanism: grammar 消除 OOV relation names (DocRED RV 29.66%→0.03%) + 非标 entity types (ET 2.48%→0%)。all_set F1 方法下 OOV=FP → fewer FP → higher precision/F1。SciERC baseline RV/ET 已很低，效果不显著。\n19\t- **Grammar 层是 F1 提升的唯一来源**: grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37% (Δ+0.01pp, p=0.66)。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献，专注 DR reduction。\n20\t\n21\t## Core Claims\n22\t\n23\t### Claim 1 (Empirical): Violation Landscape\n24\tLLM-based IE systems violate ontology type constraints at non-trivial rates (15.4% per-triple on SciERC, 18.7% on DocRED). Violations are **not uniformly distributed** — they concentrate on relation types with tight domain/range constraints (Feature-of 33.5%, Compare 42.4%) while loose-constraint relations show near-zero violation (Used-for 0.8%).\n25\t\n26\t**Key insight**: Violation rate is driven by **constraint tightness**, not ontology size. A small ontology with tight constraints can produce more violations than a large ontology with loose constraints.\n27\t\n28\t**D014 修订**: DR reduction ceiling 由 **tightness × model RV baseline** 共同决定，非 tightness 单因素。Llama DocRED DR↓90.2% vs Qwen DR↓44.7%（同一 ontology τ̄=0.842）。机制：Qwen RV=29.66% >> Llama RV=16.03% → grammar 层将 OOV triples 强制匹配有效关系名 → 揭露大量 latent DR violations → 残余 DR 更高。这是比单一 tightness 更深的 insight。\n29\t\n30\t**Evidence**: SciERC (7 relations) 15.4%; DocRED (96 relations) 18.7% — comparable rates despite 14× ontology size difference. Schema-informed prompt on DocRED only achieves DR↓32% (vs SciERC ↓62%), confirming **prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity**.\n31\t\n32\t### Claim 2 (Empirical): Prompt Insufficiency\n33\tSchema-informed prompting (explicitly describing domain/range constraints in the prompt) reduces but does not eliminate violations:\n34\t- Overall: 15.4% → 5.78% (-62.4%), still above 5%\n35\t- Per-relation: Compare 42.4% → 27.6%, Evaluate-for 24.1% → 29.9% (**worse**)\n36\t- Prompt intervention is unreliable at the per-relation level — some relations improve, one regresses\n37\t\n38\t**Narrative**: This is NOT about \"5.78% barely above 5%\". The story is: **prompt-level intervention is fundamentally unreliable as a guarantee mechanism**. It works statistically but cannot provide per-instance compliance. Three specific relation types retain >10% violation rates with schema-informed prompts. For safety-critical IE (biomedical, legal, regulatory), statistical reduction is insufficient — guaranteed compliance is required.\n39\t\n40\t### Claim 3 (Methodological): Composable Constraint Framework\n41\tOntoCoDec automatically compiles IE ontology schemas into two composable constraint layers:\n42\t1. **Grammar layer** (XGrammar): JSON structure + type vocabulary constraints (CFG-expressible)\n43\t2. **Semantic layer** (TypeConstraintProcessor): Cross-field domain/range constraints via stateful entity registry + dynamic logit masking\n44\t\n45\tThe two layers are **complementary with enabling dependency**: grammar ensures every generated relation type is in the valid vocabulary, which enables the semantic layer to look up and enforce domain/range rules for that type. Without grammar, the semantic layer encounters unknown relation types and cannot enforce constraints (explaining why semantic_only achieves only ↓24% vs full_s1 ↓94%). This is NOT \"synergistic\" (mutual amplification) — grammar is a prerequisite for semantic, not vice versa.\n46\t\n47\tThe two layers compose via bitwise AND of token masks. Recommended framing: \"Grammar and semantic constraints compose via bitwise AND with an enabling dependency: grammar ensures structural validity, enabling semantic constraints to enforce domain/range rules. When constraint tightness creates empty intersection between layers, the system degrades gracefully to grammar-only constraints, maintaining structural validity as a guaranteed floor.\"\n48\t\n49\t**Graceful degradation + Fallback 频率量化** (D008 + Reviewer 发现):\n50\tWhen $M_{semantic} \\cap M_{grammar} = \\emptyset$, the system falls back to grammar-only control.\n51\t\n52\t**关键量化数据（Reviewer 从日志挖掘）**:\n53\t- Llama DocRED full_s1: **32,921 次 fallback / 577 docs = ~57 次/doc**\n54\t- Llama SciERC full_s1: **5,882 次 fallback / 550 docs = ~10.7 次/doc**\n55\t- DocRED fallback 频率是 SciERC 的 **5.3×**\n56\t- Qwen DocRED fallback 率未知（日志当时无 fallback logging，需估算）\n57\t\n58\t**这直接解释了 DocRED DR 残余 10.19% vs SciERC 0.93%**: 更多 token 位置退化为 grammar-only → grammar-only 的 DR 已知为 26.17% → 高 fallback = 高残余 DR。\n59\t\n60\t**论文建议**: 在 §5 tightness 段报告 fallback 率，定义 \"Constraint Coverage\" 指标（semantic masking 实际生效的 token 比例）。这把 \"10.19% DR 残余\" 从弱点变成可量化分析的 finding。Frame as \"engineering robustness\" in §4; fallback 频率 + tightness 作为 §5 定量分析。\n61\t\n62\t**Decidability taxonomy**: Constraints classified by prefix-decidability:\n63\t- (a) Purely local: entity type ∈ vocabulary (grammar layer)\n64\t- (b) Prefix-decidable with state: relation argument types compatible with domain/range (semantic layer, requires entity registry)\n65\t- (c) Truly non-local: forward coreference — out of scope for forward-only decoding\n66\t\n67\t### Claim 4 (Methodological): S1 vs S2 Decoding Strategies — Architectural Ablation\n68\t- S1 (single-pass): Both layers applied throughout generation. **Recommended primary strategy** — simpler, slightly better metrics across the board.\n69\t- S2 (two-pass): Pass 1 extracts entities (grammar-only), Pass 2 generates relations with input-dependent grammar compiled from Pass 1 entities.\n70\t\n71\t**S2 full results (551/551 SciERC)**: DR 0.97% (vs S1 0.93%), CF 8.03% (vs S1 9.9%), R-F1 8.03% (vs S1 8.36%). S2 does NOT solve CF — the 1.87pp reduction is not significant. S2 also slightly worse on DR and F1. **S2 is an architectural variant demonstrating framework flexibility, not a CF solution.** Position in paper as ablation (Section 5 or Appendix), not as a core contribution.\n72\t\n73\t⚠️ **Do NOT cite pilot50 DR=0% as S2 evidence** — small-sample artifact; full run shows DR=0.97%. Per-relation S2 DR is worse than S1 on Compare (4.6% vs 2.82%), Part-of (1.25% vs 0%), Used-for (0.12% vs 0%).\n74\t\n75\t### Claim 5 (Empirical): Cross-Task Generalization — Event Extraction (D040, NEW)\n76\t**Status**: ✅ All 3 models × 246 docs complete (v3 with collision fix + exact-match fix)\n77\t\n78\tOntoCoDec generalizes beyond Relation Extraction to **Event Extraction** (WikiEvents, Li et al. NAACL 2021), demonstrating that the framework is task-agnostic for any IE task with ontology-defined type constraints.\n79\t\n80\t**Cross-task framing (Reviewer 评估 confirmed)**:\n81\t- **RoV 是 DR 的正确对应物**（不是 RV）：EE 中 per-type violation rate 是 RE 的 3-5×，支持 \"more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement\" claim\n82\t- **三层级联 Grammar→RoV→AC**（比 RE 的 Grammar→DR 两层更丰富）：grammar 消除 EV，使 semantic layer 可以 enforce role restriction (RoV→0%)，进而暴露 AC violations。这强化 architecture contribution 论证。\n83\t- **Semantic layer 是 EE 的唯一防线**：grammar 层对 role vocabulary 无能力，只有 semantic layer + continuation masking 能 enforce per-event-type role constraints\n84\t- **\"Practical value\" 防线**：Arg F1 ≈ 0% 不削弱 claim，因为 (a) mechanism generalization 是 contribution 不是 SOTA performance，(b) FT composability 已在 RE 中证明 high-F1 场景有效\n85\t\n86\t**WikiEvents specifics** (DARPA KAIROS ontology):\n87\t- 56 event types × 80 argument roles × 27 entity types（含 5 个补充 Contact 子类型 + CRM entity type）\n88\t- 245 组显式 (event_type, role) → allowed_entity_types 约束\n89\t- Maps directly to OntoCoDec's semantic layer: argument role type constraints ≡ domain/range constraints\n90\t- 27 entity types（比 ACE05 的 7 个更丰富）→ constraint space 更大，更能展示 semantic layer 价值\n91\t- 99.98% 数据满足约束 → 约束定义是真实有效的\n92\t- Hierarchical event names (e.g., Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode) → 扁平化为 leaf-node 解决 first-token collision（96.1%→3.9%）\n93\t\n94\t**数据集选择理由**（MAVEN/RAMS 排除）：\n95\t- MAVEN (168 types): 无 argument extraction，不适用\n96\t- MAVEN-Arg (162 types): FrameNet-based，无 role→entity_type schema 约束\n97\t- RAMS (139 types): 仅 cardinality 约束，无 entity type binding\n98\t- ACE05 (33 types): LDC 付费，采购周期来不及\n99\t- **WikiEvents 是唯一同时满足 \"免费 + 有显式 role→entity_type 约束\" 的数据集**\n100\t\n101\t**Violation 分类** (5 类，从 RE 的 4 类扩展):\n102\t- ET (Entity Type): entity type 不在 ontology 合法类型列表中\n103\t- EV (Event Vocabulary): event type 不在 ontology 定义中\n104\t- RoV (Role Vocabulary): argument role 不在该 event type 定义中\n105\t- AC (Argument Constraint): argument entity type 不满足 role→entity_type 约束（DR 的自然推广）\n106\t- CF (Cross-Field): 同一 entity 跨 event 被赋予不同 type\n107\t\n108\t**Full results (246 docs, v3 final — collision fix + exact-match fix)**:\n109\t\n110\t| Metric | Qwen3-8B uncon. | Qwen3-8B Full S1 | Llama-3.1-8B uncon. | Llama-3.1-8B Full S1 | Mistral-7B uncon. | Mistral-7B Full S1 |\n111\t|--------|-----------------|-------------------|---------------------|----------------------|-------------------|---------------------|\n112\t| Parse | 88.6% | 83.7% | 91.9% | 84.1% | 88.6% | 88.6% |\n113\t| EV | 24.0% | **0%** | 10.5% | **0%** | 37.3% | **0%** |\n114\t| RoV | 74.9% | **0%** | 88.8% | **0%** | 63.9% | **0%** |\n115\t| AC | 0.3% | 2.1% | 0.1% | 3.8% | 0% | 1.3% |\n116\t| CF | 0% | 21.1% | 0% | 17.2% | 0% | 14.9% |\n117\t| Trigger F1 | 11.8% | 13.4% | 5.7% | 7.5% | 2.4% | 3.9% |\n118\t| Ent F1 | 0% | 14.1% | 0% | 17.6% | 0% | 11.7% |\n119\t\n120\t**Grammar-only ablation (Mistral v3, all 3 models)**:\n121\t- Grammar eliminates EV→0% but RoV remains 64-77%: grammar CFG cannot constrain 80 argument roles conditioned on event context\n122\t- AC rises to 8-14% under grammar-only (latent violation surfacing pattern, same as DocRED RE)\n123\t- Proves semantic layer is essential for EE: two-layer architecture is necessary, not just convenient\n124\t\n125\t**Post-hoc filtering comparison (devastating)**:\n126\t- Qwen: 5,467→23 arguments (99.6% discarded) to reach 0% violation\n127\t- Llama: 5,053→3 arguments (99.9% discarded)\n128\t- Mistral: 6,034→0 arguments (100% discarded)\n129\t- Post-hoc is not viable for EE (contrasts with RE where it's expensive but functional)\n130\t\n131\t**BPE collision diagnostic (confirmed 2026-05-18)**:\n132\t- Qwen (BPE, ~152K vocab): **0 collision groups** — all 27 entity types have unique first tokens\n133\t- Llama (BPE, ~128K vocab): **0 collision groups** — same\n134\t- Mistral (SentencePiece, ~32K vocab): **2 collision groups** (SID/SEN/SIDE→'S', BAL/BOD→'B')\n135\t- **Residual AC narrative**: Mistral AC 1.3% = residual after collision fix (was 16.6%); Qwen/Llama AC 2.1-3.8% = purely model semantic confusion (confuses similar entity types like SID vs SEN), NOT tokenizer collision\n136\t\n137\t**关键 findings**:\n138\t- RoV 是压倒性违规（64-89%），远超 RE 的 RV（1-30%）→ 更强力展示 constraint 需求\n139\t- EV 显著（10-37%）→ grammar 层直接消除\n140\t- **Entity F1 从 0% 恢复到 11.7-17.6%**: 不是语义改进，是 format compliance 恢复——grammar enforcement 产生 schema-valid JSON，parser 才能识别 entity mentions\n141\t- Trigger F1 +1.5 to +1.8pp: elimination of OOV event types counted as FP\n142\t- CF 15-21% 比 RE 更高（EE argument structure 更复杂），沿用 RE 的 CF tradeoff framing\n143\t\n144\t**Story upgrade**: WikiEvents results confirm paper narrative: \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework applicable to any IE task with formal type constraints\". Three evidence lines: (1) EV/RoV→0% across all models, (2) grammar-only ablation proves two-layer necessity, (3) post-hoc filtering is non-viable for EE. This is the key differentiator for conference main vs Findings.\n145\t\n146\t**70B scale experiment** (P029-P030, in progress): Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC + DocRED to demonstrate scale generalization. If successful, adds a 4th model to cross-model evidence, strengthening C5.\n147\t\n148\t**Remaining risk**:\n149\t- CF 15-21% higher than RE → continues CF tradeoff framing\n150\t- 70B experiment timeline tight (need results by May 20 for paper integration)\n151\t\n152\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n153\t\n154\t### C1: \"5.78% is barely above 5% — threshold is arbitrary\"\n155\t**Response**: Don't argue about the threshold. Argue about per-relation distribution: Compare (27.6%), Evaluate-for (29.9%), Feature-of (11.3%) have double-digit violation rates with schema-informed prompt. The value proposition is per-relation guaranteed compliance, not overall statistical rate.\n156\t\n157\t### C2: \"Why not just post-hoc filter?\"\n158\t**Response (D013, 实验结果已出)**:\n159\t\n160\tPost-hoc filtering 实验结果：post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1（SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.24）——因 low F1 regime 下移除 FP 大幅提升 precision。\n161\t\n162\t**论文 framing（不以 F1 论高低，多维对比）**:\n163\t1. **Recall 维度（核心论点）**: OntoCoDec recall 上升 (SciERC +0.20pp, DocRED +0.56pp) = 概率质量重分配到合法 token 生效。Post-hoc recall 下降 (SciERC -0.72pp, DocRED -1.06pp) = 正确 triple 被误删。\n164\t2. **Information coverage**: DocRED post-hoc 丢弃 **48.1%** triples（近半数信息丢失），SciERC 16.8%。OntoCoDec 保留全部 triple slots。\n165\t3. **Operational**: OntoCoDec 产出即合规、无需后处理、支持流式。Post-hoc 需额外管线、不适用实时场景。\n166\t4. **Precision trade-off（诚实承认）**: \"Post-hoc achieves higher precision by removing a large fraction of triples, many of which are incorrect. This trades information coverage for precision — valid when FP are costly, but inadequate when completeness matters.\"\n167\t\n168\t数据表：SciERC post-hoc rejection 16.8%, OntoCoDec recall 11.60 vs post-hoc 10.68; DocRED post-hoc rejection 48.1%, OntoCoDec recall 10.02 vs post-hoc 8.40。\n169\t\n170\t**Reviewer 补充发现（D013 后）**:\n171\t5. **ET 残余**：post-hoc 只删 triples 不改 entity list，残余 ET=0.4% (SciERC) / 2.47% (DocRED)。OntoCoDec ET=0%。Post-hoc 无法解决 entity type 违规。\n172\t6. **127 个被删 TP (DocRED)**：过滤前 TP=1137，过滤后 TP=1010。丢失的 127 个 TP（11.2%）是正确提取但 entity type 违规的 triple。OntoCoDec 通过生成时强制合法 type 保留这些 TP——\"prevent vs detect\" 核心论据的具体数据。\n173\t7. **OntoCoDec+post-hoc 组合**（future work idea）：先 constrain 再 filter 残余 DR。低优先级，May 19 前不做。\n174\t\n175\t### C3: \"Bitwise AND of two masks is not novel\"\n176\t**Response**: The novelty is not the AND operation — it's (a) the automatic compilation from ontology definitions (zero-code schema compliance), (b) the stateful entity registry enabling cross-field constraints during autoregressive generation, (c) the decidability taxonomy providing theoretical guidance, and (d) the systematic violation landscape measurement motivating the approach.\n177\t\n178\t### C4: \"Evaluate-for violation rate increases with schema-informed prompt\"\n179\t**Response (prior-constraint conflict framework)**: Evaluate-for has 23/36 valid pairs; Method→Task is invalid for Evaluate-for but natural in the LLM's distributional prior (\"Method X evaluates for Task Y\" is semantically plausible). Schema-informed prompting creates a **prior-constraint conflict**: the model learns to avoid Method→Task for Evaluate-for (reducing count 133→87, -34.6%), but the remaining instances are harder boundary cases where the model's type assignment strategy becomes less stable. This is not just \"harder instances\" — it's an active interference between prompt-level constraint signals and the model's learned type associations.\n180\t\n181\t**This strengthens the paper's claim**: prompt-level intervention is not merely insufficient but potentially **counterproductive** for specific constraint configurations. Decoding-time enforcement avoids this issue entirely — it operates on logits, not on the model's reasoning process, so there is no prior-constraint conflict.\n182\t\n183\t### C5: \"Only tested on one model (Qwen3-8B)\"\n184\t**Response**: Cross-model validation DONE (D016 bootstrap verified). Llama-3.1-8B 零代码修改：\n185\t- SciERC: DR 13.34%→0.08% (↓99.4%), R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS\n186\t- DocRED: DR 26.07%→2.55% (↓90.2%), R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013, significant), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022, modest decline)\n187\t- Parse failures: unconstrained 68 vs full_s1 91 (6.8% vs 9.1%)\n188\t\n189\t**Cross-model claim 指导（Reviewer 专项评估）**:\n190\t- ✅ 可声明：\"OntoCoDec generalizes across model families without code modification\"（程序性事实，铁证）\n191\t- ❌ 不可声明：\"consistently achieves the same reduction rate\"（仅 2 模型，不足以量化声明）\n192\t- **RV↓DR↑ 正交性 finding**: Llama RV baseline 低(16%) 但 DR baseline 高(26%)，反向于 Qwen。证明两层约束解决正交 failure modes——vocabulary compliance ≠ semantic compliance。应作为 §5 cross-model 独立 finding 展开。\n193\t- **Parse failure 偏差**: checker skip parse failures (不计入 F1)，Llama 68/998=6.8% vs Qwen 12/998=1.2%。偏差方向保守（不利于 constrained），不威胁 claim。但需 footnote 披露 + cross-model 表增加 parse failure rate 行。\n194\t- **Llama SciERC CF=6.56%**: 比 Qwen 同量级更高，non-local constraint 问题在 Llama 上更突出，limitations 提及。\n195\t- 等 llama_docred_full_s1 出来后定最终 claim 措辞。\n196\t\n197\t### C6: \"Constrained decoding degrades generation quality (CRANE, Structure Snowballing)\"\n198\t**Response**: OntoCoDec's semantic constraints are narrower than full grammar constraints — only type tokens are masked, free text is unconstrained. **Bootstrap CI (10000×, D012 Qwen + D016 Llama, all registry-aligned)**:\n199\t\n200\t**Qwen3-8B**: SciERC R-F1 +0.13pp (p=0.58, NS), E-F1 -0.03pp (NS). DocRED R-F1 +0.50pp (p<0.001), E-F1 +1.23pp (p<0.001).\n201\t**Llama-3.1-8B**: SciERC R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS. DocRED R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022).\n202\t\n203\t**Cross-model pattern**: DocRED R-F1 显著提升（两个模型）。E-F1 model-dependent（Qwen +1.23pp, Llama -0.64pp）。\n204\t- 机制：grammar 消除 OOV relation names + 非标 entity types → all_set 方法下减少 FP → precision 提升。Grammar 是 F1 提升的唯一来源（grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37%, Δ=0.01pp, p=0.66）。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献。\n205\t- Frame as: \"On DocRED, R-F1 gains are significant for both models. Entity F1 impact is model-dependent.\"\n206\t- 不升级为 core claim，但如实报告。\n207\t\n208\t### C7: \"Your method trades DR violations for CF violations (cross-field consistency)\"\n209\t**Response**: Both S1 and S2 show elevated CF (per-triple rate ~8-10%). This is an inherent limitation of per-relation independent type enforcement. Must be proactively reported as a limitation. Defense:\n210\t\n211\t**CF 子类型分析（根因已确认）**：\n212\t- **EVR（entity-vs-relation type drift）**: 占 CF 的 >90%。同一 entity 在 entity list 和 relation triple 中被赋予不同 type。S1: 245 entities (7.34%), S2: 178 entities (5.54%, -27%)\n213\t- **Within-rel（同 entity 跨 relation type 不一致）**: S1: 10 (0.36%), S2: 18 (0.72%)\n214\t- S2 减少 EVR 但增加 within-rel——trade-off 更复杂，不是单纯好/差\n215\t\n216\t**Top 冲突模式**: Generic↔OtherScientificTerm (60次), Material↔OtherScientificTerm (28次), Material↔Method (20次)。**这些是 SciERC type system 固有的语义边界模糊区**——同一术语在不同学术语境下确实可以被合理归类为不同 type。CF 在相当程度上是 type system 模糊性的体现，非纯粹的方法缺陷。\n217\t\n218\t**论证层次**：\n219\t1. DR violations = structurally invalid triples（下游系统不可用）→ hard constraint\n220\t2. CF violations = same entity gets different types across relations → individual triples remain type-valid, only cross-triple consistency broken → soft preference\n221\t3. CF 的根因是 type system 语义边界模糊 + per-relation 独立 enforcement，非 bug\n222\t4. Future work: cross-relation global consistency pass (entity-level type consensus before relation-specific enforcement)\n223\t\n224\t**机制归因（口径对账确认）**：grammar_only CF=0.08%（与 unconstrained 持平），full_s1 CF=9.90%，full_s2 CF=8.03%。**CF 100% 由 semantic 层引入，grammar 层无贡献。** 这为 \"CF 是 semantic type enforcement 的系统性副作用\" 提供干净的消融证据。\n225\t\n226\t**论文数字口径**：CF rate 用 violation_checker 口径（denominator=total_entities，与 DR/RV/ET 一致）。分析段落额外给 entity-level EVR 率 + 受影响样本比例。注意：analyze_cf 脚本的 EVR/WR 两维度不是独立的（WR⊂EVR），论文中不要作为两个独立维度报告。\n227\t\n228\t**Do NOT hide this data.** Proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis + type ambiguity evidence + 消融归因 = 最强防御策略。\n229\t\n230\t### C8: \"Absolute F1 is too low (~8%) — results are not meaningful\"\n231\t**Response**: This is a zero-shot extraction setting (no training data, no fine-tuning). Low F1 is expected — supervised SOTA on SciERC relation F1 is ~40-50%. Our contribution is the constraint enforcement method, not extraction quality. F1 is a control variable verifying constraints don't degrade quality, not an optimization target. Recommended framing: \"We evaluate in a zero-shot setting to demonstrate that our constraint enforcement method works without task-specific training. F1 is reported to verify that constraint enforcement does not degrade extraction quality, not as a claim of state-of-the-art performance.\"\n232\t\n233\t## Paper Structure (Draft — D040 updated)\n234\t1. Introduction: Ontology constraint violations in LLM-based structured generation + composable framework overview (story: not just RE, general ontology-constrained generation)\n235\t2. Background: Grammar-constrained decoding (XGrammar) + IE ontology structure\n236\t3. Violation Landscape Study (Phase 0 empirics — independent contribution)\n237\t4. OntoCoDec Framework: Compiler + TypeConstraintProcessor + S1/S2 strategies\n238\t5. Experiments:\n239\t   - §5.1-5.3: RE experiments (SciERC + DocRED, 3 models, constrained vs unconstrained vs post-hoc vs prompt-based)\n240\t   - §5.4: **Event Extraction (WikiEvents)** — cross-task generalization (D040)\n241\t   - §5.5: Ablation + analysis (composability, latency, beam search, etc.)\n242\t6. Related Work: 5 constraint paradigms (grammar, vocabulary, structural, type-checking, ontology) + event extraction methods\n243\t7. Conclusion: Framework generality across IE tasks\n244\t\n245\t## Claim Calibration (per Reviewer assessment)\n246\t\n247\t**Safe to claim (sufficient evidence from Phase 2)**:\n248\t- \"First systematic study of ontology constraint violations in LLM-based IE\"\n249\t- \"Violation rate correlates with constraint tightness, not ontology size\" (D014: DR reduction ceiling 由 tightness × model RV baseline 共同决定)\n250\t- \"Grammar+semantic constrained decoding eliminates 94% of DR violations at zero F1 cost\" ✅ Phase 2 confirmed\n251\t- \"Two-layer architecture provides complementary coverage — grammar enables semantic\" ✅ Ablation confirmed\n252\t- \"Prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity\" ✅ SciERC ↓62% vs DocRED ↓32%\n253\t\n254\t**Claim with caution**:\n255\t- \"Near-complete type-valid IE\" — S1 0.93%, S2 0.97% residual, not truly 0%. Title updated to \"Near-Complete\"\n256\t- \"Principled framework applicable to arbitrary IE ontologies\" — RE validated on 2 datasets × 2 models; EE (WikiEvents) 10-doc preliminary shows ↓95.8% semantic violations, full results pending\n257\t- \"F1 improvement\" — SciERC: not significant (p=0.58), frame as F1-neutral; DocRED: significant (+0.50pp, p<0.001), 可报告但不升级为 core claim，归因于 OOV elimination 而非约束解码本身的提升\n258\t- \"CF reveals type system ambiguity\" — 可在 §5.3 作为 analysis finding 展开（Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 等模式有独立 insight 价值），但 §7 必须同时保留 CF 作为 limitation + future work。**两处都要有，缺一不可。** 不能暗示\"因为是 type ambiguity 所以 CF 可接受\"\n259\t\n260\t**Do NOT claim**:\n261\t- \"General infrastructure for IE\" — only zero-shot extraction validated\n262\t- \"State-of-the-art\" — F1 is control variable, not optimization target (see C8)\n263\t- \"Synergistic effect\" — mechanism is enabling dependency, not mutual amplification (see Claim 3)\n264\t- \"S2 solves CF\" or \"S2 mitigates Structure Snowballing\" — data shows S2 ≈ S1 on all metrics; position as architectural variant only\n265\t- \"Pilot50 DR=0%\" — small-sample artifact, full S2 has DR=0.97%\n266\t- \"Grammar-first invariant\" 作为独立 claim — 证据不足（仅 1 次崩溃触发，实现是 fallback 非形式化保证）。写入 §4 方法论设计原则（1-2 句），不升级为 claim\n267\t- \"Robust dual-layer composition across schema complexities\" — 等 DocRED 完成。最终如 fallback ≤5/998，可写经验性陈述，不做泛化 claim\n268\t\n269\t## Risk Ranking (ordered by reject probability)\n270\t\n271\t1. **CF violation trade-off under-addressed** (MEDIUM-HIGH): S1 9.9%, S2 8.03% — both elevated. **S2 confirmed: does NOT solve CF.** This is the #1 attack surface. Mitigated by proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis (C7). Must be reported as explicit limitation with future work direction (global entity-type consensus).\n272\t2. ~~**Single model limitation**~~ (RESOLVED): Llama-3.1-8B SciERC ✅ (DR↓99.4%) + DocRED ✅ (DR↓90.2%). 2 模型 × 2 数据集全矩阵完成。\n273\t3. **Novelty perception** (MEDIUM): \"PLDI'25 for code → OntoCoDec for IE\" attack line. Must argue IE constraint structure differs fundamentally.\n274\t4. ~~**DocRED Phase 2 weak**~~ (RESOLVED → reframed as D014): Qwen DR↓44.7%, Llama DR↓90.2% — both substantial. Weaker Qwen reduction explained by RV baseline interaction (D014), not method failure.\n275\t5. ~~**Phase 2 F1 drop**~~ (RESOLVED): F1 confirmed neutral (SciERC) or positive (DocRED, p<0.001). Bootstrap CI D012 confirms. No longer a risk.\n276\t\n277\t## Critical Path to EMNLP Submission (May 25)\n278\t\n279\t- **May 13-14**: Phase 0 + Phase 1 + Phase 2 SciERC ✅\n280\t- **May 14**: Phase 2 DocRED 4-way ablation ✅ + Llama SciERC cross-model ✅ + Dream 完成 (3/6)\n281\t- **May 14-15**: Llama DocRED ✅ + Checker 修正 ✅ + post-hoc ✅ + bootstrap CI ✅ + related work ✅\n282\t- **May 15-17**: Prompt sensitivity ✅ + WikiEvents pipeline 开发 + continuation v2 突破\n283\t- **May 17-18**: WikiEvents 3 模型 unconstrained baselines (进行中) + constrained 全量\n284\t- **May 18-19**: WikiEvents 结果分析 + §5.4 Event Extraction 章节撰写\n285\t- **May 19-20**: Intro/Abstract/Conclusion 升级（cross-task story）+ 内部稿 → submit_paper_to_review\n286\t- **May 20-24**: Review 修改 + 最终提交\n287\t\n288\t**当前瓶颈**: WikiEvents 全量实验完成是关键路径。3 模型 unconstrained baselines 并行进行中（Qwen ~68/246, Mistral ~31/246, Llama 重启中），constrained 实验随后立即启动。\n289\t\n290\t## Status\n291\t- Phase 0 SciERC: ✅ Complete (minimal + schema-informed)\n292\t- Phase 0 DocRED: ✅ Complete (minimal 18.7% DR + schema-informed 12.8% DR)\n293\t- Phase 1 Compiler: ✅ Complete (grammar + semantic layers integrated)\n294\t- Phase 2 SciERC (5 configs): ✅ Complete (S1 DR↓94% F1-neutral, S2 降级为 ablation)\n295\t- Phase 2 DocRED (4 configs): ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓45%, grammar ET/RV→0%)\n296\t- Llama SciERC cross-model: ✅ Complete (DR↓99.4%, F1-neutral, 零代码修改)\n297\t- Llama DocRED cross-model: ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓90.2%, unconstrained DR=26.07%)\n298\t- Checker v2 (D011): ✅ Fixed (ET triple-counting → unique entity dedup)\n299\t- Bootstrap CI (D012): ✅ Fixed + confirmed (entity filter bug resolved)\n300\t- Post-hoc baseline (D013): ✅ Complete (multi-dimensional framing)\n301\t- Related work: ✅ 42 bib entries, 4 additions merged\n302\t- Dream 6/6 actions: ✅ All complete\n303\t- CF violation analysis: ✅ Confirmed inherent limitation (S1 9.9% SciERC / 2.57% DocRED / 12.02% Llama DocRED)\n304\t- D014 tightness revision: ✅ Complete (tightness × RV baseline dual-factor)\n305\t- Llama bootstrap CI (D016): ✅ Fixed + verified (registry-aligned ≤0.05pp, all p-values in paper)\n306\t- Paper compilation: ✅ 8 pages正文 + appendix\n307\t- R5 text fixes (N1/N2/N3/W1-W6): ✅ All complete and verified\n308\t- Prompt sensitivity analysis: ✅ Complete (3 prompts × 2 modes, DR reduction 94.0-94.6%, σ=0.3pp; appendix written)\n309\t- Doc length breakdown: ✅ Complete (appendix written)\n310\t- **WikiEvents Event Extraction (D040)**: 🔄 Continuation v2 突破 (10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic ↓95.8%); 3 模型 unconstrained baselines 进行中; constrained 全量待启动\n311\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"225c2df4-1f7c-4f2b-8568-320b8c495b50","uuid":"a4145670-85e2-489e-a02a-0f7e27603907","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:01:42.243Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T162745/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# OntoCoDec — Paper Framing\n\n## Target Venue\nEMNLP 2026 (ARR submission May 25, 2026) — **目标: conference main**（D040, 用户明确指示）\n\n## Title\nOntoCoDec: Type-Valid Information Extraction via Compiled Ontology Constraints\n(D015: \"Near-Complete\" dropped — DocRED residual DR=10.21% (Qwen) 不算 near-complete。论文贡献是方法，不是特定消除率。SciERC 0.93% 和 DocRED 2.55% (Llama) 可在正文中描述为 near-complete，但 title 不宜 overclaim。)\n\n**D040 Story 升级方向**: 从 \"IE-specific constrained decoding\" → \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework\"。WikiEvents Event Extraction 验证跨任务泛化。Continuation masking v2 突破（10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic violations ↓95.8%）初步确认跨任务有效性，全量实验进行中。最终 title 待全量结果后调整。\n\n## Core Insight\nLLM-based IE systems produce systematic ontology constraint violations concentrated in specific relation types. Prompt-level intervention (schema-informed prompting) reduces violations by ~62% but cannot eliminate them — certain relation types retain 25-30% violation rates even with explicit constraint descriptions. OntoCoDec provides **near-complete elimination (DR 15.4%→0.93%, ↓94%) at zero or positive F1 impact** through automatic ontology-to-decoder constraint compilation with two complementary layers.\n\n**Phase 2 confirmed (D012 bootstrap CI, v2 fix)**: Grammar+Semantic dual-layer constrained decoding reduces domain/range violations by 94%, eliminates entity-type and relation-vocabulary violations entirely (→0%). F1 impact is **dataset-dependent**:\n- SciERC: Rel F1 neutral (+0.13pp, p=0.58), Ent F1 neutral (-0.03pp, p=0.53)\n- DocRED: Rel F1 **significantly improved** (+0.50pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.23, +0.81]); Ent F1 **significantly improved** (+1.23pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.94, +1.55])\n- Mechanism: grammar 消除 OOV relation names (DocRED RV 29.66%→0.03%) + 非标 entity types (ET 2.48%→0%)。all_set F1 方法下 OOV=FP → fewer FP → higher precision/F1。SciERC baseline RV/ET 已很低，效果不显著。\n- **Grammar 层是 F1 提升的唯一来源**: grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37% (Δ+0.01pp, p=0.66)。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献，专注 DR reduction。\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### Claim 1 (Empirical): Violation Landscape\nLLM-based IE systems violate ontology type constraints at non-trivial rates (15.4% per-triple on SciERC, 18.7% on DocRED). Violations are **not uniformly distributed** — they concentrate on relation types with tight domain/range constraints (Feature-of 33.5%, Compare 42.4%) while loose-constraint relations show near-zero violation (Used-for 0.8%).\n\n**Key insight**: Violation rate is driven by **constraint tightness**, not ontology size. A small ontology with tight constraints can produce more violations than a large ontology with loose constraints.\n\n**D014 修订**: DR reduction ceiling 由 **tightness × model RV baseline** 共同决定，非 tightness 单因素。Llama DocRED DR↓90.2% vs Qwen DR↓44.7%（同一 ontology τ̄=0.842）。机制：Qwen RV=29.66% >> Llama RV=16.03% → grammar 层将 OOV triples 强制匹配有效关系名 → 揭露大量 latent DR violations → 残余 DR 更高。这是比单一 tightness 更深的 insight。\n\n**Evidence**: SciERC (7 relations) 15.4%; DocRED (96 relations) 18.7% — comparable rates despite 14× ontology size difference. Schema-informed prompt on DocRED only achieves DR↓32% (vs SciERC ↓62%), confirming **prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity**.\n\n### Claim 2 (Empirical): Prompt Insufficiency\nSchema-informed prompting (explicitly describing domain/range constraints in the prompt) reduces but does not eliminate violations:\n- Overall: 15.4% → 5.78% (-62.4%), still above 5%\n- Per-relation: Compare 42.4% → 27.6%, Evaluate-for 24.1% → 29.9% (**worse**)\n- Prompt intervention is unreliable at the per-relation level — some relations improve, one regresses\n\n**Narrative**: This is NOT about \"5.78% barely above 5%\". The story is: **prompt-level intervention is fundamentally unreliable as a guarantee mechanism**. It works statistically but cannot provide per-instance compliance. Three specific relation types retain >10% violation rates with schema-informed prompts. For safety-critical IE (biomedical, legal, regulatory), statistical reduction is insufficient — guaranteed compliance is required.\n\n### Claim 3 (Methodological): Composable Constraint Framework\nOntoCoDec automatically compiles IE ontology schemas into two composable constraint layers:\n1. **Grammar layer** (XGrammar): JSON structure + type vocabulary constraints (CFG-expressible)\n2. **Semantic layer** (TypeConstraintProcessor): Cross-field domain/range constraints via stateful entity registry + dynamic logit masking\n\nThe two layers are **complementary with enabling dependency**: grammar ensures every generated relation type is in the valid vocabulary, which enables the semantic layer to look up and enforce domain/range rules for that type. Without grammar, the semantic layer encounters unknown relation types and cannot enforce constraints (explaining why semantic_only achieves only ↓24% vs full_s1 ↓94%). This is NOT \"synergistic\" (mutual amplification) — grammar is a prerequisite for semantic, not vice versa.\n\nThe two layers compose via bitwise AND of token masks. Recommended framing: \"Grammar and semantic constraints compose via bitwise AND with an enabling dependency: grammar ensures structural validity, enabling semantic constraints to enforce domain/range rules. When constraint tightness creates empty intersection between layers, the system degrades gracefully to grammar-only constraints, maintaining structural validity as a guaranteed floor.\"\n\n**Graceful degradation + Fallback 频率量化** (D008 + Reviewer 发现):\nWhen $M_{semantic} \\cap M_{grammar} = \\emptyset$, the system falls back to grammar-only control.\n\n**关键量化数据（Reviewer 从日志挖掘）**:\n- Llama DocRED full_s1: **32,921 次 fallback / 577 docs = ~57 次/doc**\n- Llama SciERC full_s1: **5,882 次 fallback / 550 docs = ~10.7 次/doc**\n- DocRED fallback 频率是 SciERC 的 **5.3×**\n- Qwen DocRED fallback 率未知（日志当时无 fallback logging，需估算）\n\n**这直接解释了 DocRED DR 残余 10.19% vs SciERC 0.93%**: 更多 token 位置退化为 grammar-only → grammar-only 的 DR 已知为 26.17% → 高 fallback = 高残余 DR。\n\n**论文建议**: 在 §5 tightness 段报告 fallback 率，定义 \"Constraint Coverage\" 指标（semantic masking 实际生效的 token 比例）。这把 \"10.19% DR 残余\" 从弱点变成可量化分析的 finding。Frame as \"engineering robustness\" in §4; fallback 频率 + tightness 作为 §5 定量分析。\n\n**Decidability taxonomy**: Constraints classified by prefix-decidability:\n- (a) Purely local: entity type ∈ vocabulary (grammar layer)\n- (b) Prefix-decidable with state: relation argument types compatible with domain/range (semantic layer, requires entity registry)\n- (c) Truly non-local: forward coreference — out of scope for forward-only decoding\n\n### Claim 4 (Methodological): S1 vs S2 Decoding Strategies — Architectural Ablation\n- S1 (single-pass): Both layers applied throughout generation. **Recommended primary strategy** — simpler, slightly better metrics across the board.\n- S2 (two-pass): Pass 1 extracts entities (grammar-only), Pass 2 generates relations with input-dependent grammar compiled from Pass 1 entities.\n\n**S2 full results (551/551 SciERC)**: DR 0.97% (vs S1 0.93%), CF 8.03% (vs S1 9.9%), R-F1 8.03% (vs S1 8.36%). S2 does NOT solve CF — the 1.87pp reduction is not significant. S2 also slightly worse on DR and F1. **S2 is an architectural variant demonstrating framework flexibility, not a CF solution.** Position in paper as ablation (Section 5 or Appendix), not as a core contribution.\n\n⚠️ **Do NOT cite pilot50 DR=0% as S2 evidence** — small-sample artifact; full run shows DR=0.97%. Per-relation S2 DR is worse than S1 on Compare (4.6% vs 2.82%), Part-of (1.25% vs 0%), Used-for (0.12% vs 0%).\n\n### Claim 5 (Empirical): Cross-Task Generalization — Event Extraction (D040, NEW)\n**Status**: ✅ All 3 models × 246 docs complete (v3 with collision fix + exact-match fix)\n\nOntoCoDec generalizes beyond Relation Extraction to **Event Extraction** (WikiEvents, Li et al. NAACL 2021), demonstrating that the framework is task-agnostic for any IE task with ontology-defined type constraints.\n\n**Cross-task framing (Reviewer 评估 confirmed)**:\n- **RoV 是 DR 的正确对应物**（不是 RV）：EE 中 per-type violation rate 是 RE 的 3-5×，支持 \"more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement\" claim\n- **三层级联 Grammar→RoV→AC**（比 RE 的 Grammar→DR 两层更丰富）：grammar 消除 EV，使 semantic layer 可以 enforce role restriction (RoV→0%)，进而暴露 AC violations。这强化 architecture contribution 论证。\n- **Semantic layer 是 EE 的唯一防线**：grammar 层对 role vocabulary 无能力，只有 semantic layer + continuation masking 能 enforce per-event-type role constraints\n- **\"Practical value\" 防线**：Arg F1 ≈ 0% 不削弱 claim，因为 (a) mechanism generalization 是 contribution 不是 SOTA performance，(b) FT composability 已在 RE 中证明 high-F1 场景有效\n\n**WikiEvents specifics** (DARPA KAIROS ontology):\n- 56 event types × 80 argument roles × 27 entity types（含 5 个补充 Contact 子类型 + CRM entity type）\n- 245 组显式 (event_type, role) → allowed_entity_types 约束\n- Maps directly to OntoCoDec's semantic layer: argument role type constraints ≡ domain/range constraints\n- 27 entity types（比 ACE05 的 7 个更丰富）→ constraint space 更大，更能展示 semantic layer 价值\n- 99.98% 数据满足约束 → 约束定义是真实有效的\n- Hierarchical event names (e.g., Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode) → 扁平化为 leaf-node 解决 first-token collision（96.1%→3.9%）\n\n**数据集选择理由**（MAVEN/RAMS 排除）：\n- MAVEN (168 types): 无 argument extraction，不适用\n- MAVEN-Arg (162 types): FrameNet-based，无 role→entity_type schema 约束\n- RAMS (139 types): 仅 cardinality 约束，无 entity type binding\n- ACE05 (33 types): LDC 付费，采购周期来不及\n- **WikiEvents 是唯一同时满足 \"免费 + 有显式 role→entity_type 约束\" 的数据集**\n\n**Violation 分类** (5 类，从 RE 的 4 类扩展):\n- ET (Entity Type): entity type 不在 ontology 合法类型列表中\n- EV (Event Vocabulary): event type 不在 ontology 定义中\n- RoV (Role Vocabulary): argument role 不在该 event type 定义中\n- AC (Argument Constraint): argument entity type 不满足 role→entity_type 约束（DR 的自然推广）\n- CF (Cross-Field): 同一 entity 跨 event 被赋予不同 type\n\n**Full results (246 docs, v3 final — collision fix + exact-match fix)**:\n\n| Metric | Qwen3-8B uncon. | Qwen3-8B Full S1 | Llama-3.1-8B uncon. | Llama-3.1-8B Full S1 | Mistral-7B uncon. | Mistral-7B Full S1 |\n|--------|-----------------|-------------------|---------------------|----------------------|-------------------|---------------------|\n| Parse | 88.6% | 83.7% | 91.9% | 84.1% | 88.6% | 88.6% |\n| EV | 24.0% | **0%** | 10.5% | **0%** | 37.3% | **0%** |\n| RoV | 74.9% | **0%** | 88.8% | **0%** | 63.9% | **0%** |\n| AC | 0.3% | 2.1% | 0.1% | 3.8% | 0% | 1.3% |\n| CF | 0% | 21.1% | 0% | 17.2% | 0% | 14.9% |\n| Trigger F1 | 11.8% | 13.4% | 5.7% | 7.5% | 2.4% | 3.9% |\n| Ent F1 | 0% | 14.1% | 0% | 17.6% | 0% | 11.7% |\n\n**Grammar-only ablation (Mistral v3, all 3 models)**:\n- Grammar eliminates EV→0% but RoV remains 64-77%: grammar CFG cannot constrain 80 argument roles conditioned on event context\n- AC rises to 8-14% under grammar-only (latent violation surfacing pattern, same as DocRED RE)\n- Proves semantic layer is essential for EE: two-layer architecture is necessary, not just convenient\n\n**Post-hoc filtering comparison (devastating)**:\n- Qwen: 5,467→23 arguments (99.6% discarded) to reach 0% violation\n- Llama: 5,053→3 arguments (99.9% discarded)\n- Mistral: 6,034→0 arguments (100% discarded)\n- Post-hoc is not viable for EE (contrasts with RE where it's expensive but functional)\n\n**BPE collision diagnostic (confirmed 2026-05-18)**:\n- Qwen (BPE, ~152K vocab): **0 collision groups** — all 27 entity types have unique first tokens\n- Llama (BPE, ~128K vocab): **0 collision groups** — same\n- Mistral (SentencePiece, ~32K vocab): **2 collision groups** (SID/SEN/SIDE→'S', BAL/BOD→'B')\n- **Residual AC narrative**: Mistral AC 1.3% = residual after collision fix (was 16.6%); Qwen/Llama AC 2.1-3.8% = purely model semantic confusion (confuses similar entity types like SID vs SEN), NOT tokenizer collision\n\n**关键 findings**:\n- RoV 是压倒性违规（64-89%），远超 RE 的 RV（1-30%）→ 更强力展示 constraint 需求\n- EV 显著（10-37%）→ grammar 层直接消除\n- **Entity F1 从 0% 恢复到 11.7-17.6%**: 不是语义改进，是 format compliance 恢复——grammar enforcement 产生 schema-valid JSON，parser 才能识别 entity mentions\n- Trigger F1 +1.5 to +1.8pp: elimination of OOV event types counted as FP\n- CF 15-21% 比 RE 更高（EE argument structure 更复杂），沿用 RE 的 CF tradeoff framing\n\n**Story upgrade**: WikiEvents results confirm paper narrative: \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework applicable to any IE task with formal type constraints\". Three evidence lines: (1) EV/RoV→0% across all models, (2) grammar-only ablation proves two-layer necessity, (3) post-hoc filtering is non-viable for EE. This is the key differentiator for conference main vs Findings.\n\n**70B scale experiment** (P029-P030, in progress): Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC + DocRED to demonstrate scale generalization. If successful, adds a 4th model to cross-model evidence, strengthening C5.\n\n**Remaining risk**:\n- CF 15-21% higher than RE → continues CF tradeoff framing\n- 70B experiment timeline tight (need results by May 20 for paper integration)\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### C1: \"5.78% is barely above 5% — threshold is arbitrary\"\n**Response**: Don't argue about the threshold. Argue about per-relation distribution: Compare (27.6%), Evaluate-for (29.9%), Feature-of (11.3%) have double-digit violation rates with schema-informed prompt. The value proposition is per-relation guaranteed compliance, not overall statistical rate.\n\n### C2: \"Why not just post-hoc filter?\"\n**Response (D013, 实验结果已出)**:\n\nPost-hoc filtering 实验结果：post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1（SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.24）——因 low F1 regime 下移除 FP 大幅提升 precision。\n\n**论文 framing（不以 F1 论高低，多维对比）**:\n1. **Recall 维度（核心论点）**: OntoCoDec recall 上升 (SciERC +0.20pp, DocRED +0.56pp) = 概率质量重分配到合法 token 生效。Post-hoc recall 下降 (SciERC -0.72pp, DocRED -1.06pp) = 正确 triple 被误删。\n2. **Information coverage**: DocRED post-hoc 丢弃 **48.1%** triples（近半数信息丢失），SciERC 16.8%。OntoCoDec 保留全部 triple slots。\n3. **Operational**: OntoCoDec 产出即合规、无需后处理、支持流式。Post-hoc 需额外管线、不适用实时场景。\n4. **Precision trade-off（诚实承认）**: \"Post-hoc achieves higher precision by removing a large fraction of triples, many of which are incorrect. This trades information coverage for precision — valid when FP are costly, but inadequate when completeness matters.\"\n\n数据表：SciERC post-hoc rejection 16.8%, OntoCoDec recall 11.60 vs post-hoc 10.68; DocRED post-hoc rejection 48.1%, OntoCoDec recall 10.02 vs post-hoc 8.40。\n\n**Reviewer 补充发现（D013 后）**:\n5. **ET 残余**：post-hoc 只删 triples 不改 entity list，残余 ET=0.4% (SciERC) / 2.47% (DocRED)。OntoCoDec ET=0%。Post-hoc 无法解决 entity type 违规。\n6. **127 个被删 TP (DocRED)**：过滤前 TP=1137，过滤后 TP=1010。丢失的 127 个 TP（11.2%）是正确提取但 entity type 违规的 triple。OntoCoDec 通过生成时强制合法 type 保留这些 TP——\"prevent vs detect\" 核心论据的具体数据。\n7. **OntoCoDec+post-hoc 组合**（future work idea）：先 constrain 再 filter 残余 DR。低优先级，May 19 前不做。\n\n### C3: \"Bitwise AND of two masks is not novel\"\n**Response**: The novelty is not the AND operation — it's (a) the automatic compilation from ontology definitions (zero-code schema compliance), (b) the stateful entity registry enabling cross-field constraints during autoregressive generation, (c) the decidability taxonomy providing theoretical guidance, and (d) the systematic violation landscape measurement motivating the approach.\n\n### C4: \"Evaluate-for violation rate increases with schema-informed prompt\"\n**Response (prior-constraint conflict framework)**: Evaluate-for has 23/36 valid pairs; Method→Task is invalid for Evaluate-for but natural in the LLM's distributional prior (\"Method X evaluates for Task Y\" is semantically plausible). Schema-informed prompting creates a **prior-constraint conflict**: the model learns to avoid Method→Task for Evaluate-for (reducing count 133→87, -34.6%), but the remaining instances are harder boundary cases where the model's type assignment strategy becomes less stable. This is not just \"harder instances\" — it's an active interference between prompt-level constraint signals and the model's learned type associations.\n\n**This strengthens the paper's claim**: prompt-level intervention is not merely insufficient but potentially **counterproductive** for specific constraint configurations. Decoding-time enforcement avoids this issue entirely — it operates on logits, not on the model's reasoning process, so there is no prior-constraint conflict.\n\n### C5: \"Only tested on one model (Qwen3-8B)\"\n**Response**: Cross-model validation DONE (D016 bootstrap verified). Llama-3.1-8B 零代码修改：\n- SciERC: DR 13.34%→0.08% (↓99.4%), R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS\n- DocRED: DR 26.07%→2.55% (↓90.2%), R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013, significant), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022, modest decline)\n- Parse failures: unconstrained 68 vs full_s1 91 (6.8% vs 9.1%)\n\n**Cross-model claim 指导（Reviewer 专项评估）**:\n- ✅ 可声明：\"OntoCoDec generalizes across model families without code modification\"（程序性事实，铁证）\n- ❌ 不可声明：\"consistently achieves the same reduction rate\"（仅 2 模型，不足以量化声明）\n- **RV↓DR↑ 正交性 finding**: Llama RV baseline 低(16%) 但 DR baseline 高(26%)，反向于 Qwen。证明两层约束解决正交 failure modes——vocabulary compliance ≠ semantic compliance。应作为 §5 cross-model 独立 finding 展开。\n- **Parse failure 偏差**: checker skip parse failures (不计入 F1)，Llama 68/998=6.8% vs Qwen 12/998=1.2%。偏差方向保守（不利于 constrained），不威胁 claim。但需 footnote 披露 + cross-model 表增加 parse failure rate 行。\n- **Llama SciERC CF=6.56%**: 比 Qwen 同量级更高，non-local constraint 问题在 Llama 上更突出，limitations 提及。\n- 等 llama_docred_full_s1 出来后定最终 claim 措辞。\n\n### C6: \"Constrained decoding degrades generation quality (CRANE, Structure Snowballing)\"\n**Response**: OntoCoDec's semantic constraints are narrower than full grammar constraints — only type tokens are masked, free text is unconstrained. **Bootstrap CI (10000×, D012 Qwen + D016 Llama, all registry-aligned)**:\n\n**Qwen3-8B**: SciERC R-F1 +0.13pp (p=0.58, NS), E-F1 -0.03pp (NS). DocRED R-F1 +0.50pp (p<0.001), E-F1 +1.23pp (p<0.001).\n**Llama-3.1-8B**: SciERC R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS. DocRED R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022).\n\n**Cross-model pattern**: DocRED R-F1 显著提升（两个模型）。E-F1 model-dependent（Qwen +1.23pp, Llama -0.64pp）。\n- 机制：grammar 消除 OOV relation names + 非标 entity types → all_set 方法下减少 FP → precision 提升。Grammar 是 F1 提升的唯一来源（grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37%, Δ=0.01pp, p=0.66）。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献。\n- Frame as: \"On DocRED, R-F1 gains are significant for both models. Entity F1 impact is model-dependent.\"\n- 不升级为 core claim，但如实报告。\n\n### C7: \"Your method trades DR violations for CF violations (cross-field consistency)\"\n**Response**: Both S1 and S2 show elevated CF (per-triple rate ~8-10%). This is an inherent limitation of per-relation independent type enforcement. Must be proactively reported as a limitation. Defense:\n\n**CF 子类型分析（根因已确认）**：\n- **EVR（entity-vs-relation type drift）**: 占 CF 的 >90%。同一 entity 在 entity list 和 relation triple 中被赋予不同 type。S1: 245 entities (7.34%), S2: 178 entities (5.54%, -27%)\n- **Within-rel（同 entity 跨 relation type 不一致）**: S1: 10 (0.36%), S2: 18 (0.72%)\n- S2 减少 EVR 但增加 within-rel——trade-off 更复杂，不是单纯好/差\n\n**Top 冲突模式**: Generic↔OtherScientificTerm (60次), Material↔OtherScientificTerm (28次), Material↔Method (20次)。**这些是 SciERC type system 固有的语义边界模糊区**——同一术语在不同学术语境下确实可以被合理归类为不同 type。CF 在相当程度上是 type system 模糊性的体现，非纯粹的方法缺陷。\n\n**论证层次**：\n1. DR violations = structurally invalid triples（下游系统不可用）→ hard constraint\n2. CF violations = same entity gets different types across relations → individual triples remain type-valid, only cross-triple consistency broken → soft preference\n3. CF 的根因是 type system 语义边界模糊 + per-relation 独立 enforcement，非 bug\n4. Future work: cross-relation global consistency pass (entity-level type consensus before relation-specific enforcement)\n\n**机制归因（口径对账确认）**：grammar_only CF=0.08%（与 unconstrained 持平），full_s1 CF=9.90%，full_s2 CF=8.03%。**CF 100% 由 semantic 层引入，grammar 层无贡献。** 这为 \"CF 是 semantic type enforcement 的系统性副作用\" 提供干净的消融证据。\n\n**论文数字口径**：CF rate 用 violation_checker 口径（denominator=total_entities，与 DR/RV/ET 一致）。分析段落额外给 entity-level EVR 率 + 受影响样本比例。注意：analyze_cf 脚本的 EVR/WR 两维度不是独立的（WR⊂EVR），论文中不要作为两个独立维度报告。\n\n**Do NOT hide this data.** Proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis + type ambiguity evidence + 消融归因 = 最强防御策略。\n\n### C8: \"Absolute F1 is too low (~8%) — results are not meaningful\"\n**Response**: This is a zero-shot extraction setting (no training data, no fine-tuning). Low F1 is expected — supervised SOTA on SciERC relation F1 is ~40-50%. Our contribution is the constraint enforcement method, not extraction quality. F1 is a control variable verifying constraints don't degrade quality, not an optimization target. Recommended framing: \"We evaluate in a zero-shot setting to demonstrate that our constraint enforcement method works without task-specific training. F1 is reported to verify that constraint enforcement does not degrade extraction quality, not as a claim of state-of-the-art performance.\"\n\n## Paper Structure (Draft — D040 updated)\n1. Introduction: Ontology constraint violations in LLM-based structured generation + composable framework overview (story: not just RE, general ontology-constrained generation)\n2. Background: Grammar-constrained decoding (XGrammar) + IE ontology structure\n3. Violation Landscape Study (Phase 0 empirics — independent contribution)\n4. OntoCoDec Framework: Compiler + TypeConstraintProcessor + S1/S2 strategies\n5. Experiments:\n   - §5.1-5.3: RE experiments (SciERC + DocRED, 3 models, constrained vs unconstrained vs post-hoc vs prompt-based)\n   - §5.4: **Event Extraction (WikiEvents)** — cross-task generalization (D040)\n   - §5.5: Ablation + analysis (composability, latency, beam search, etc.)\n6. Related Work: 5 constraint paradigms (grammar, vocabulary, structural, type-checking, ontology) + event extraction methods\n7. Conclusion: Framework generality across IE tasks\n\n## Claim Calibration (per Reviewer assessment)\n\n**Safe to claim (sufficient evidence from Phase 2)**:\n- \"First systematic study of ontology constraint violations in LLM-based IE\"\n- \"Violation rate correlates with constraint tightness, not ontology size\" (D014: DR reduction ceiling 由 tightness × model RV baseline 共同决定)\n- \"Grammar+semantic constrained decoding eliminates 94% of DR violations at zero F1 cost\" ✅ Phase 2 confirmed\n- \"Two-layer architecture provides complementary coverage — grammar enables semantic\" ✅ Ablation confirmed\n- \"Prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity\" ✅ SciERC ↓62% vs DocRED ↓32%\n\n**Claim with caution**:\n- \"Near-complete type-valid IE\" — S1 0.93%, S2 0.97% residual, not truly 0%. Title updated to \"Near-Complete\"\n- \"Principled framework applicable to arbitrary IE ontologies\" — RE validated on 2 datasets × 2 models; EE (WikiEvents) 10-doc preliminary shows ↓95.8% semantic violations, full results pending\n- \"F1 improvement\" — SciERC: not significant (p=0.58), frame as F1-neutral; DocRED: significant (+0.50pp, p<0.001), 可报告但不升级为 core claim，归因于 OOV elimination 而非约束解码本身的提升\n- \"CF reveals type system ambiguity\" — 可在 §5.3 作为 analysis finding 展开（Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 等模式有独立 insight 价值），但 §7 必须同时保留 CF 作为 limitation + future work。**两处都要有，缺一不可。** 不能暗示\"因为是 type ambiguity 所以 CF 可接受\"\n\n**Do NOT claim**:\n- \"General infrastructure for IE\" — only zero-shot extraction validated\n- \"State-of-the-art\" — F1 is control variable, not optimization target (see C8)\n- \"Synergistic effect\" — mechanism is enabling dependency, not mutual amplification (see Claim 3)\n- \"S2 solves CF\" or \"S2 mitigates Structure Snowballing\" — data shows S2 ≈ S1 on all metrics; position as architectural variant only\n- \"Pilot50 DR=0%\" — small-sample artifact, full S2 has DR=0.97%\n- \"Grammar-first invariant\" 作为独立 claim — 证据不足（仅 1 次崩溃触发，实现是 fallback 非形式化保证）。写入 §4 方法论设计原则（1-2 句），不升级为 claim\n- \"Robust dual-layer composition across schema complexities\" — 等 DocRED 完成。最终如 fallback ≤5/998，可写经验性陈述，不做泛化 claim\n\n## Risk Ranking (ordered by reject probability)\n\n1. **CF violation trade-off under-addressed** (MEDIUM-HIGH): S1 9.9%, S2 8.03% — both elevated. **S2 confirmed: does NOT solve CF.** This is the #1 attack surface. Mitigated by proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis (C7). Must be reported as explicit limitation with future work direction (global entity-type consensus).\n2. ~~**Single model limitation**~~ (RESOLVED): Llama-3.1-8B SciERC ✅ (DR↓99.4%) + DocRED ✅ (DR↓90.2%). 2 模型 × 2 数据集全矩阵完成。\n3. **Novelty perception** (MEDIUM): \"PLDI'25 for code → OntoCoDec for IE\" attack line. Must argue IE constraint structure differs fundamentally.\n4. ~~**DocRED Phase 2 weak**~~ (RESOLVED → reframed as D014): Qwen DR↓44.7%, Llama DR↓90.2% — both substantial. Weaker Qwen reduction explained by RV baseline interaction (D014), not method failure.\n5. ~~**Phase 2 F1 drop**~~ (RESOLVED): F1 confirmed neutral (SciERC) or positive (DocRED, p<0.001). Bootstrap CI D012 confirms. No longer a risk.\n\n## Critical Path to EMNLP Submission (May 25)\n\n- **May 13-14**: Phase 0 + Phase 1 + Phase 2 SciERC ✅\n- **May 14**: Phase 2 DocRED 4-way ablation ✅ + Llama SciERC cross-model ✅ + Dream 完成 (3/6)\n- **May 14-15**: Llama DocRED ✅ + Checker 修正 ✅ + post-hoc ✅ + bootstrap CI ✅ + related work ✅\n- **May 15-17**: Prompt sensitivity ✅ + WikiEvents pipeline 开发 + continuation v2 突破\n- **May 17-18**: WikiEvents 3 模型 unconstrained baselines (进行中) + constrained 全量\n- **May 18-19**: WikiEvents 结果分析 + §5.4 Event Extraction 章节撰写\n- **May 19-20**: Intro/Abstract/Conclusion 升级（cross-task story）+ 内部稿 → submit_paper_to_review\n- **May 20-24**: Review 修改 + 最终提交\n\n**当前瓶颈**: WikiEvents 全量实验完成是关键路径。3 模型 unconstrained baselines 并行进行中（Qwen ~68/246, Mistral ~31/246, Llama 重启中），constrained 实验随后立即启动。\n\n## Status\n- Phase 0 SciERC: ✅ Complete (minimal + schema-informed)\n- Phase 0 DocRED: ✅ Complete (minimal 18.7% DR + schema-informed 12.8% DR)\n- Phase 1 Compiler: ✅ Complete (grammar + semantic layers integrated)\n- Phase 2 SciERC (5 configs): ✅ Complete (S1 DR↓94% F1-neutral, S2 降级为 ablation)\n- Phase 2 DocRED (4 configs): ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓45%, grammar ET/RV→0%)\n- Llama SciERC cross-model: ✅ Complete (DR↓99.4%, F1-neutral, 零代码修改)\n- Llama DocRED cross-model: ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓90.2%, unconstrained DR=26.07%)\n- Checker v2 (D011): ✅ Fixed (ET triple-counting → unique entity dedup)\n- Bootstrap CI (D012): ✅ Fixed + confirmed (entity filter bug resolved)\n- Post-hoc baseline (D013): ✅ Complete (multi-dimensional framing)\n- Related work: ✅ 42 bib entries, 4 additions merged\n- Dream 6/6 actions: ✅ All complete\n- CF violation analysis: ✅ Confirmed inherent limitation (S1 9.9% SciERC / 2.57% DocRED / 12.02% Llama DocRED)\n- D014 tightness revision: ✅ Complete (tightness × RV baseline dual-factor)\n- Llama bootstrap CI (D016): ✅ Fixed + verified (registry-aligned ≤0.05pp, all p-values in paper)\n- Paper compilation: ✅ 8 pages正文 + appendix\n- R5 text fixes (N1/N2/N3/W1-W6): ✅ All complete and verified\n- Prompt sensitivity analysis: ✅ Complete (3 prompts × 2 modes, DR reduction 94.0-94.6%, σ=0.3pp; appendix written)\n- Doc length breakdown: ✅ Complete (appendix written)\n- **WikiEvents Event Extraction (D040)**: 🔄 Continuation v2 突破 (10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic ↓95.8%); 3 模型 unconstrained baselines 进行中; constrained 全量待启动\n","numLines":311,"startLine":1,"totalLines":311}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QtLny4w26FdqhAibsNaZba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the experiment data and paper framing. Let me also check if the output directory exists.\n\nLet me now write the complete LaTeX paper. I need to:\n\n1. Use all experiment data from experiment_data.json\n2. Follow the narrative guidance (median tier adjustments)\n3. Include sections for every experiment\n4. Write a complete paper from \\documentclass to \\end{document}\n\nKey narrative adjustments per median tier:\n1. 70B results → §5.5 supplementary, \"violations persist at scale but diminish\"\n2. Cross-task claim → \"generalizable framework validated on two structurally distinct IE tasks\" (not \"universal\")\n\n\n3. The tightness×RV interaction belongs in the quantitative analysis section, emphasizing how it enables the dependency and decidability taxonomy\n4. The CF tradeoff gets addressed as a practical beam search mitigation strategy in the supplementary section\n5. Target confidence levels: findings are solid, main results borderline\n\nI'll structure the paper with abstract, introduction, background, then the violation landscape study and OntoCoDec framework, followed by experiments covering relation extraction on SciERC and DocRED with multiple models, event extraction on WikiEvents for cross-task validation, and ablation studies examining grammar-only components.\n\nNow I'm compiling the numerical results from the relation extraction experiments. I have the SciERC data with Qwen3-8B showing unconstrained violation rates around 15.4%, dropping to 5.78% with schema-informed constraints and further to 0.93% with the full framework, along with corresponding F1 metrics and statistical significance levels. I need to organize these carefully alongside the other experimental conditions and model variants. Now I'm looking at the performance metrics for DocRED and WikiEvents across different models, examining how the constraint interventions affect parsing accuracy, relation extraction, and event argument classification rates. Now I'm looking at the performance metrics for Llama on WikiEvents Full S1, which shows similar parsing accuracy to Qwen but with better entity F1 scores. Then there's Mistral's results on the same dataset, followed by the grammar-only variant where Mistral and Qwen show notably different strengths—Qwen excels at RoV while Mistral performs better on trigger F1.\n\nThe post-hoc event extraction results are striking: all three models collapse to near-zero argument F1 scores despite reducing argument counts dramatically, suggesting they're essentially guessing on argument extraction. Finally, I'm examining the 70B SciERC results, which show much lower performance across the board compared to WikiEvents, with the constrained variant appearing to degrade further. Looking at the bootstrap confidence intervals, all the improvements are statistically significant—Qwen and Llama show particularly strong gains on entity F1 (14 and 17 percentage points respectively), while trigger F1 improvements are more modest across all models. The error analysis breaks down the remaining issues: about half stem from annotation inconsistencies or format problems, with the rest being cases where the constraint approach couldn't recover the correct answer.\n\nFor fine-tuning composability, the constrained version actually performs slightly better on most metrics while dramatically reducing hallucinations—95% fewer duplicate relations—though it trades off some role classification accuracy. Latency on SciERC is minimal at 13.1%.\n\nNow I'm looking at the overhead across different datasets: DocRED shows about 21.5% latency increase, and WikiEvents is estimated around 26%. I'm planning out the paper structure, starting with introduction and background, then the core framework, followed by experiments covering relation extraction, event extraction as a cross-task evaluation, ablations, and analysis sections.\n\nI'm deciding on the LaTeX template—since this is a simulation paper without strict venue requirements, I'll go with a basic article class to keep things simple and ensure it compiles cleanly. Now I'm ready to write out the full paper with all the experimental data and results.\n\nI need to make sure I cover every experiment from the data: the main RE and EE results tables comparing constrained versus unconstrained approaches across multiple models, the grammar-only ablation, post-hoc rejection comparisons, the 70B scale analysis, latency measurements, fine-tuning composability, confidence intervals, and qualitative error analysis. I'm aiming for roughly 8 pages of content with a narrative that positions the 70B results as supplementary evidence that constraint violations persist but diminish at scale, and emphasizes how the framework generalizes across two structurally different IE tasks.\n\nNow I'm working through the key framing points: the tightness and RV interaction as part of the quantitative analysis, the coverage-fidelity tradeoff with beam search as a practical mitigation strategy, and keeping the focus on enabling dependency-based constraints and the decidability taxonomy.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22690,"cache_read_input_tokens":24756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22690},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"225c2df4-1f7c-4f2b-8568-320b8c495b50","uuid":"eea3b2a1-2c90-4fa2-8515-881a344e0dbf"}
